('b77bd38c-108a-5ab5-9543-676bfa5a743a','35b148ad-045e-5f7b-bb2b-dfd896a5551e',1,'somebody who reads','کسی که می خواند','spoken & written','someone who reads books, or who reads in a particular way',null,null,'خواننده، قاری؛ خواننده (دستگاه)؛ خواننده (نظر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a slow/fast reader Her son was quite a slow reader.','a good reader He''s not a good reader but he wants to try a new story.','a poor reader (= someone who is not good at reading ) All these students had been judged to be poor readers.','a great reader (= someone who reads a lot of books ) My father was a great reader.','an avid/voracious reader (= someone who eagerly reads a lot of books ) She was an avid reader of historical novels.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The book will appeal to young readers.","translation":"این کتاب برای خوانندگان جوان جذاب خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604293.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve always been an avid reader (= someone who reads a lot ) .","translation":"من همیشه یک خواننده مشتاق (= کسی که زیاد می‌خواند) بوده‌ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000483006.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s a great reader of crime fiction.","translation":"او یک خواننده عالی داستان های جنایی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604300.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('4de11df4-07fc-5ff8-bb0c-a981a210bf25','35b148ad-045e-5f7b-bb2b-dfd896a5551e',2,'of a newspaper/magazine','یک روزنامه/مجله','spoken & written','someone who reads a particular newspaper or magazine regularly',null,null,'کسی که به طور منظم یک روزنامه یا مجله خاص را مطالعه می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a slow/fast reader Her son was quite a slow reader.','a good reader He''s not a good reader but he wants to try a new story.','a poor reader (= someone who is not good at reading ) All these students had been judged to be poor readers.','a great reader (= someone who reads a lot of books ) My father was a great reader.','an avid/voracious reader (= someone who eagerly reads a lot of books ) She was an avid reader of historical novels.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The newspaper gradually lost readers during the 1980s.","translation":"روزنامه در طول دهه 1980 به تدریج خوانندگان خود را از دست داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001604302.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('fca90d99-fc9a-5a83-af1a-dfe33694b702','35b148ad-045e-5f7b-bb2b-dfd896a5551e',3,'book','کتاب','spoken & written','an easy book for children who are learning to read or for people who are learning a foreign language',null,null,'کتابی آسان برای کودکانی که در حال یادگیری خواندن هستند یا برای افرادی که در حال یادگیری یک زبان خارجی هستند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a slow/fast reader Her son was quite a slow reader.','a good reader He''s not a good reader but he wants to try a new story.','a poor reader (= someone who is not good at reading ) All these students had been judged to be poor readers.','a great reader (= someone who reads a lot of books ) My father was a great reader.','an avid/voracious reader (= someone who eagerly reads a lot of books ) She was an avid reader of historical novels.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
