('f45ee597-d9ac-5b6d-879c-73b48eee091b','9e3769e2-3b91-53db-9720-7830cde7c0de',1,null,null,'spoken','to think or suppose something',null,null,'پنداشتن، حساب کردن (بر روی)؛ محاسبه کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Do you reckon he’ll agree to see us?","translation":"آیا فکر می کنید او با دیدن ما موافقت می کند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000760743.mp3"},{"sentence":"The police reckon that whoever killed Dad was with him earlier that day.","translation":"پلیس فکر می کند که هر کس پدر را کشته است اوایل آن روز با او بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001613954.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘There’s nothing we can do about it.’ ‘You reckon (= used to express doubt or disagreement ) ?’","translation":"\"ما هیچ کاری نمی توانیم در مورد آن انجام دهیم.\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771324.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('cacb4269-8330-5eec-967f-20f3ae841a84','9e3769e2-3b91-53db-9720-7830cde7c0de',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to guess a number or amount , without calculating it exactly',null,null,'حدس زدن یک عدد یا مقدار، بدون محاسبه دقیق آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We reckon that sitting in traffic jams costs us around $9 billion a year in lost output.","translation":"ما بر این باوریم که نشستن در ترافیک برای ما حدود 9 میلیارد دلار در سال هزینه از دست داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001613957.mp3"},{"sentence":"The average selling price for flats in the area was reckoned to be around £200,000.","translation":"میانگین قیمت فروش آپارتمان در این منطقه حدود 200000 پوند در نظر گرفته شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000760753.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b0e5c656-d6e0-5ca8-9ad1-d154e5fc3dd2','9e3769e2-3b91-53db-9720-7830cde7c0de',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to think that someone or something is a particular kind of person or thing',null,null,'فکر کردن به اینکه کسی یا چیزی نوع خاصی از شخص یا چیز است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The Lowsons were reckoned to be very good farmers.","translation":"لوسون‌ها کشاورزان بسیار خوبی هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000760763.mp3"},{"sentence":"Moving house is reckoned to be nearly as stressful as divorce.","translation":"تغییر خانه تقریباً به اندازه طلاق استرس زا است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001613962.mp3"},{"sentence":"An earthquake of magnitude 7 is reckoned as a major quake.","translation":"زلزله ای به بزرگی 7 ریشتر به عنوان یک زمین لرزه بزرگ به حساب می آید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001613965.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('0757f0dc-b7ea-571f-81ee-7fbe5d014742','9e3769e2-3b91-53db-9720-7830cde7c0de',4,null,null,'formal','to calculate an amount',null,null,'برای محاسبه یک مقدار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The expression ‘full moon’ means the fourteenth day of the moon reckoned from its first appearance.","translation":"تعبیر «ماه کامل» به معنای روز چهاردهم ماه است که از اولین ظهور آن محاسبه می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000760771.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('674679ec-f6e9-5d98-957d-9fe11f851803','fa98909e-ddcf-54b8-83ac-2def50402672',1,'information','اطلاعات','spoken & written','information about something that is written down or stored on computer, film etc so that it can be looked at in the future','[ countable ]',null,'سابقه، سابقه (کار)؛ رکورد (بازی)؛ پرونده (پلیس)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the records show something Official records show that 44 businesses have stopped trading in the last 12 months.','keep a record Teachers keep a record of students’ progress.','maintain a record formal The directors are responsible for maintaining adequate accounting records.','place/put something on record (= officially say something or write it down ) I wish to put on record my objection to the scheme.','access records ( also have/gain access to records ) (= be able to look at them ) Every citizen has the right to access their medical records.','a written record Where written records do survive, they are incomplete.','historical records Using historical records, we have produced an image of the temple.','official records This has been the wettest winter since official records began.','an accurate record Many hospitals did not keep accurate records.','a detailed record Edwardian travellers left detailed records of their journeys.','a proper record Failure to maintain proper records would be a criminal offence.','confidential records They were transferring confidential student records onto computer.','a permanent record You will have a permanent record of your work.','medical/hospital/health etc records The hospital could not find my mother’s medical records. Patients’ hospital records are kept on a database.','financial records The company’s financial records must be up-to-date.','public records (= records of births, deaths etc, that the public are allowed to look at ) He found the information while examining public records.','police records Violent assaults rose 39 percent, according to police records.','the biggest/highest etc on record Last summer was one of the hottest on record.','a matter of public record formal (= something that has been written down so that anyone can know it ) His salary is a matter of public record.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I try to keep a record of everything I spend.","translation":"سعی می‌کنم همه چیزهایی که خرج می‌کنم را ثبت کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001305.mp3"},{"sentence":"According to official records, five people were killed last year near that road junction.","translation":"طبق اسناد رسمی، سال گذشته پنج نفر در نزدیکی آن تقاطع جاده کشته شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001306.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('64d7b945-4190-574f-a964-7c71966767bd','fa98909e-ddcf-54b8-83ac-2def50402672',2,'highest/best ever','بالاترین/بهترین','spoken & written','the fastest speed , longest distance , highest or lowest level etc that has ever been achieved or reached, especially in sport','[ countable ]',null,'سریع ترین سرعت، طولانی ترین مسافت، بالاترین یا پایین ترین سطح و غیره که تا به حال به دست آمده یا رسیده است، به ویژه در ورزش','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The American team set a new world record in the sprint relay.","translation":"تیم آمریکا در رله دوی سرعت رکورد جهانی جدیدی را به نام خود ثبت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001307.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ca6bb3c1-309e-5725-b4af-8a8077c1ba78','fa98909e-ddcf-54b8-83ac-2def50402672',3,'music','موسیقی','spoken & written','a round flat piece of plastic with a hole in the middle that music and sound are stored on','[ countable ]','record player','یک قطعه پلاستیکی صاف گرد با سوراخی در وسط که موسیقی و صدا روی آن ذخیره می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I spent a lot of time listening to records .","translation":"من زمان زیادی را صرف گوش دادن به رکوردها کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771391.mp3"},{"sentence":"My dad’s got a huge record collection .","translation":"پدرم یک مجموعه رکورد بزرگ دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001771395.mp3"},{"sentence":"a major British record company","translation":"یک شرکت بزرگ ضبط موسیقی بریتانیایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761480.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('7a2c6710-a273-5c2b-bc00-b6c15ea88e5e','fa98909e-ddcf-54b8-83ac-2def50402672',4,'past activities','فعالیت های گذشته','spoken & written','the facts about how successful , good, bad etc someone or something has been in the past','[ singular ]',null,'حقایقی در مورد اینکه یک شخص یا چیزی در گذشته چقدر موفق، خوب، بد و غیره بوده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Chemistry graduates have a good record in finding employment.","translation":"فارغ التحصیلان رشته شیمی سابقه خوبی در یافتن شغل دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614181.mp3"},{"sentence":"the company’s track record in improving conditions","translation":"سابقه شرکت در بهبود شرایط","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614172.mp3"},{"sentence":"Mr Davis defended the government’s record on unemployment (= what they have done about unemployment ) .","translation":"آقای دیویس از سابقه دولت در مورد بیکاری (= کاری که آنها در مورد بیکاری انجام داده اند) دفاع کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000761492.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('4bb2b260-115c-5c5e-91ff-1662a3f2930b','fa98909e-ddcf-54b8-83ac-2def50402672',5,'crime','جنایت','spoken & written','information kept by the police that shows someone has committed a crime','[ countable ]',null,'اطلاعات نگهداری شده توسط پلیس که نشان می دهد فردی مرتکب جرم شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He’s only 18 and he already has a record.","translation":"او فقط 18 سال دارد و در حال حاضر یک رکورد دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001308.mp3"},{"sentence":"They won’t employ anyone with a criminal record.","translation":"آنها کسی را که سابقه کیفری داشته باشد به کار نمی گیرند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001309.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
