('cf01e49b-8132-5910-83ec-b132ca9f5a16','ac4cc538-28ca-5f0b-b95e-578825de8b1f',1,'take away','از بین بردن','spoken & written','to take something away from, out of, or off the place where it is',null,null,'برداشتن، جدا کردن؛ عوض کردن (جنس)؛ حذف کردن (مشکلات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Remove the old wallpaper and fill any holes in the walls.","translation":"کاغذ دیواری قدیمی را بردارید و هر سوراخی را در دیوارها پر کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000774694.mp3"},{"sentence":"Reference books may not be removed from the library.","translation":"کتاب های مرجع را نمی توان از کتابخانه حذف کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000774697.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('e3fcb68c-40f6-5d34-9618-e035f77b6643','ac4cc538-28ca-5f0b-b95e-578825de8b1f',2,'get rid of','خلاص شدن از شر','spoken & written','to get rid of something so that it does not exist any longer',null,null,'خلاص شدن از شر چیزی به طوری که دیگر وجود نداشته باشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a cleaner that will remove wine stains","translation":"پاک کننده ای که لکه های شراب را از بین می برد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000774709.mp3"},{"sentence":"The college removed rules that prevented women from enrolling.","translation":"کالج قوانینی را که مانع از ثبت نام زنان می شد را حذف کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000774710.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0c871b92-96bf-5285-8d5a-49c10a963296','ac4cc538-28ca-5f0b-b95e-578825de8b1f',3,'from a job','از یک شغل','spoken & written','to force someone out of an important position or dismiss them from a job',null,null,'مجبور کردن کسی از یک موقعیت مهم یا اخراج او از یک شغل','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Congress could remove the president from office.","translation":"کنگره می تواند رئیس جمهور را از سمت خود برکنار کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000774728.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('bd28a8b6-4da2-56e4-a2f5-a75ddb007aca','ac4cc538-28ca-5f0b-b95e-578825de8b1f',4,'clothes','لباس','formal','to take off a piece of clothing',null,null,'برای درآوردن یک تکه لباس','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He removed his hat and gloves.","translation":"کلاه و دستکشش را برداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000774703.mp3"},{"sentence":"Is it OK if I take my coat off ?","translation":"اگر کتم را در بیاورم اشکالی ندارد؟","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,2),
('3fc6d226-c085-5c5e-a91f-1f42c7fb5767','ac4cc538-28ca-5f0b-b95e-578825de8b1f',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be far removed from something','برداشتن، جدا کردن؛ عوض کردن (جنس)؛ حذف کردن (مشکلات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e3e75eb5-8360-555c-8ac7-5e1eca6412d4','ac4cc538-28ca-5f0b-b95e-578825de8b1f',6,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'cousin once/twice etc removed','برداشتن، جدا کردن؛ عوض کردن (جنس)؛ حذف کردن (مشکلات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('d44083cd-e8f4-50b3-bce3-6e417121c509','3cd56493-6a78-5d88-a8ca-23de400450b5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a distance or amount by which two things are separated',null,null,'فاصله یا مقداری که دو چیز از هم جدا می شوند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The X-ray operator works at a safe remove in a separate room.","translation":"اپراتور اشعه ایکس در یک اتاق جداگانه کار می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570592.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('404d4619-ec23-5f39-bd9c-fbbd43023201','2f6e3048-0a24-5ddf-b696-df64b40cebbf',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to fix something that is damaged , broken, split , or not working properly',null,null,'تعمیر کردن، ترمیم کردن؛ اصلاح کردن (خطا)؛ جبران کردن (ضرر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Dad was up the ladder, repairing the roof.","translation":"پدر از نردبان بالا رفته بود و سقف را تعمیر می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000775620.mp3"},{"sentence":"Where can I get my shoes repaired ?","translation":"از کجا می توانم کفش هایم را تعمیر کنم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562540.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('24a01c90-7878-5973-a11f-98c08f6ccf3f','2f6e3048-0a24-5ddf-b696-df64b40cebbf',2,null,null,'formal','to do something to remove harm that you have caused',null,null,'انجام کاری برای رفع آسیبی که ایجاد کرده اید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Neil tried to repair the damage that his statements had caused.","translation":"نیل سعی کرد آسیبی را که اظهاراتش ایجاد کرده بود ترمیم کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000775625.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4c0baf6b-3c60-5dbd-b1c9-cdcc9a5a7edb','1a6ce84a-32d5-5e81-9f7a-0216b3cb1435',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something that you do to fix a thing that is damaged, broken, or not working','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'تعمیر، ترمیم؛ تعمیرات (کار)؛ تعمیر (سازمان)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make/do a repair I have done some repairs to the chair over the years.','carry out a repair The school was closed for two months while repairs were carried out.','a minor repair (= a small one ) In the summer, we had to carry out some minor repairs to the roof.','a major repair (= a big one ) The car didn''t need to have any major repairs done.','necessary/essential repairs The Council has agreed to carry out essential repairs to the fencing.','urgent repairs More than £40,000 is needed for urgent repairs to the tower.','extensive repairs (= a lot of repair work ) The boat needed extensive repairs.','structural repairs (= to the walls or roof of a building or to the main parts of a bridge or other structure ) A survey showed that the bridge needed significant structural repairs.','electrical repairs Never attempt electrical repairs without unplugging the appliance.','running repairs (= small things that you do to something to keep it working properly ) Farm workers made their own tools and carried out their own running repairs.','be under repair (= be being repaired ) We were staying at a hotel while our house was under repair.','be in need of repair Many of the cottages were badly in need of repair.','be beyond repair/be damaged beyond repair (= be so badly damaged that it cannot be repaired ) Unfortunately the engine is beyond repair.','repair work The council has been responsible for appointing contractors to carry out this repair work.','a repair job It looked like a simple repair job to me.','a repair shop/yard (= a place where things of a particular kind are repaired ) He works in a shoe repair shop.','a repair kit (= a set of of tools or equipment that you use to repair something ) a bicycle repair kit']::text[],'[{"sentence":"repairs to the roads","translation":"تعمیرات جاده ها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562548.mp3"},{"sentence":"His job is to make minor repairs on all the machines.","translation":"وظیفه او انجام تعمیرات جزئی در تمام ماشین ها است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001876795.mp3"},{"sentence":"The church tower is in need of repair .","translation":"برج کلیسا نیاز به تعمیر دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000775655.mp3"},{"sentence":"an extensive programme of building repairs","translation":"برنامه گسترده تعمیرات ساختمان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562557.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many of the paintings were beyond repair (= so damaged that they could not be mended ) .","translation":"بسیاری از نقاشی ها قابل تعمیر نبودند (= آنقدر آسیب دیده بودند که قابل ترمیم نبودند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000775664.mp3"},{"sentence":"Is the bridge still under repair?","translation":"آیا پل هنوز در حال تعمیر است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770851.mp3"},{"sentence":"They did a good repair job on the roof.","translation":"آنها کار تعمیر پشت بام را به خوبی انجام دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562562.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('a1c7da8f-885c-5a45-a816-d68598290ebc','1a6ce84a-32d5-5e81-9f7a-0216b3cb1435',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'in good/poor etc repair','تعمیر، ترمیم؛ تعمیرات (کار)؛ تعمیر (سازمان)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make/do a repair I have done some repairs to the chair over the years.','carry out a repair The school was closed for two months while repairs were carried out.','a minor repair (= a small one ) In the summer, we had to carry out some minor repairs to the roof.','a major repair (= a big one ) The car didn''t need to have any major repairs done.','necessary/essential repairs The Council has agreed to carry out essential repairs to the fencing.','urgent repairs More than £40,000 is needed for urgent repairs to the tower.','extensive repairs (= a lot of repair work ) The boat needed extensive repairs.','structural repairs (= to the walls or roof of a building or to the main parts of a bridge or other structure ) A survey showed that the bridge needed significant structural repairs.','electrical repairs Never attempt electrical repairs without unplugging the appliance.','running repairs (= small things that you do to something to keep it working properly ) Farm workers made their own tools and carried out their own running repairs.','be under repair (= be being repaired ) We were staying at a hotel while our house was under repair.','be in need of repair Many of the cottages were badly in need of repair.','be beyond repair/be damaged beyond repair (= be so badly damaged that it cannot be repaired ) Unfortunately the engine is beyond repair.','repair work The council has been responsible for appointing contractors to carry out this repair work.','a repair job It looked like a simple repair job to me.','a repair shop/yard (= a place where things of a particular kind are repaired ) He works in a shoe repair shop.','a repair kit (= a set of of tools or equipment that you use to repair something ) a bicycle repair kit']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('887a2785-bf5e-547c-9f10-2d22787db66c','86b3ea8c-d7c9-52cc-92b3-1ed35c88c20e',1,'say again','دوباره بگو','spoken & written','to say or write something again',null,null,'تکرار کردن، دوباره گفتن؛ برگرداندن (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Can you repeat your question?","translation":"آیا می توانید سوال خود را تکرار کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000775851.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sorry – could you repeat that?","translation":"با عرض پوزش - می توانید آن را تکرار کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562612.mp3"},{"sentence":"Nick patiently repeated that he had to work that day.","translation":"نیک با حوصله تکرار کرد که باید آن روز کار کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562615.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is not, I repeat not, my fault.","translation":"تقصیر من نیست، تکرار می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562616.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘I promise, ’ she repeated.","translation":"او تکرار کرد: قول می دهم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562617.mp3"},{"sentence":"Elderly people tend to repeat themselves.","translation":"افراد مسن تمایل به تکرار خود دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562621.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('a47d102c-18a8-59ce-b087-6df3c5da1c4f','86b3ea8c-d7c9-52cc-92b3-1ed35c88c20e',2,'do again','دوباره انجام دهید','spoken & written','to do something again',null,null,'برای انجام دوباره کاری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Repeat the exercises twice a day.","translation":"تمرینات را دو بار در روز تکرار کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000775866.mp3"},{"sentence":"We must not repeat the mistakes of the past.","translation":"ما نباید اشتباهات گذشته را تکرار کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000775867.mp3"},{"sentence":"The team are hoping to repeat their success (= achieve the same good result ) of last season.","translation":"این تیم امیدوار است که موفقیت خود (= کسب همان نتیجه خوب) فصل گذشته را تکرار کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562631.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('f4f5dbc4-f0c9-5ac3-9294-a2e601abb85c','86b3ea8c-d7c9-52cc-92b3-1ed35c88c20e',3,'learn','یاد بگیرند','spoken & written','to say something that someone else has just said, especially in order to learn it',null,null,'گفتن چیزی که شخص دیگری به تازگی گفته است، به ویژه برای یادگیری آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Repeat after me: amo, amas, amat ...","translation":"بعد از من تکرار کن: آمو، آماس، امات...","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562634.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('dd0b7764-a638-5a18-9a29-d11706669cce','86b3ea8c-d7c9-52cc-92b3-1ed35c88c20e',4,'tell','بگو','spoken & written','to tell someone something that you have heard, especially something secret',null,null,'برای گفتن چیزی که شنیده ای به کسی، مخصوصاً چیزی راز','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Here’s what happened, but don’t repeat it.","translation":"این چیزی است که اتفاق افتاده است، اما آن را تکرار نکنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000775889.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('bf5adb2a-4234-577f-bccb-f0121dfdf3d3','86b3ea8c-d7c9-52cc-92b3-1ed35c88c20e',5,'broadcast','پخش شود','spoken & written','to broadcast a television or radio programme again',null,null,'برای پخش مجدد یک برنامه تلویزیونی یا رادیویی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The series will be repeated in the autumn.","translation":"این سریال در پاییز تکرار می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000775900.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('fce3b56f-3cc9-5089-a372-1f3d4d24a38a','86b3ea8c-d7c9-52cc-92b3-1ed35c88c20e',6,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'something doesn’t bear repeating','تکرار کردن، دوباره گفتن؛ برگرداندن (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('1fe7dfff-f4ee-5ca8-a5e5-ecee88013e4a','a6b4f108-5f7e-5670-bc63-c71d427b7c83',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an event that is very like something that happened before','[ usually singular ]',null,'رویدادی که بسیار شبیه به اتفاق قبلی است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The match was basically a repeat of last year’s game at Wembley.","translation":"این مسابقه اساسا تکرار بازی سال گذشته در ومبلی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000775933.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was a terrible journey – I hope we don’t have a repeat performance (= have the same thing happen again ) on the way home.","translation":"این یک سفر وحشتناک بود - امیدوارم در راه خانه یک اجرای تکراری نداشته باشیم (= دوباره همان اتفاق تکرار شود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000775937.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('9259505d-18af-5c53-9a01-01257a793596','a6b4f108-5f7e-5670-bc63-c71d427b7c83',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a television or radio programme that has been broadcast before',null,null,'یک برنامه تلویزیونی یا رادیویی که قبلاً پخش شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘Is it a repeat?’ ‘No, it’s a new series.’","translation":"«تکرار است؟» «نه، این یک سریال جدید است.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000775927.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('bc2ca885-8de1-5d61-8e76-8ca63dd797f3','a6b4f108-5f7e-5670-bc63-c71d427b7c83',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'repeat order/prescription',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('dc179c2b-38f2-582f-8030-c560aba9ba68','a6b4f108-5f7e-5670-bc63-c71d427b7c83',4,null,null,'technical','the sign that tells a performer to play a piece of music again, or the music that is played again',null,null,'علامتی که به نوازنده می‌گوید یک قطعه موسیقی را دوباره پخش کند یا موسیقی که دوباره پخش می‌شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('dc029c0e-017a-51ff-923a-5f9ba5e08d62','828f0896-f4dd-536e-a99c-1cae7c721684',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a written or spoken description of a situation or event, giving people the information they need',null,null,'گزارش، چاپ (کار)؛ گزارش (مدیر)؛ گزارش (پلیس)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['write a report Her social worker has written a report on the case.','make a report We make regular progress reports to our manager.','give a report (= make a report, usually a spoken one ) He came to the office to give his report in person.','prepare a report The surveyor will view the property and prepare a full report.','submit a report formal (= give a written report to someone ) Doctors will have to submit weekly reports.','a report says/states (that) The report said that it would cost another £250 million to repair the damage.','a full/detailed report A full report will be prepared for the next committee meeting.','an official/formal report Black graduates still face discrimination from employers, according to an official report.','a written report Mr Thomas asked me to send him a written report.','a confidential report (= one that only a few people see ) He made a confidential report to UN headquarters in New York.','an autopsy report ( also a post-mortem report British English ) (= that shows the results of an examination on a dead body to find the cause of death ) The autopsy report gave the cause of death as alcohol poisoning.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Colleges have to provide a written report on the progress of each student during the year.","translation":"کالج ها باید گزارش کتبی از پیشرفت هر دانش آموز در طول سال ارائه دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001333.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('9ec6577f-30c2-5532-b765-430ac509da8a','828f0896-f4dd-536e-a99c-1cae7c721684',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a piece of writing in a newspaper about something that is happening, or part of a news programme',null,null,'یک قطعه نوشته در روزنامه در مورد اتفاقی که در حال رخ دادن است یا بخشی از یک برنامه خبری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"According to recent news reports , two of the victims are Americans.","translation":"بر اساس گزارش های اخیر، دو تن از قربانیان آمریکایی هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607325.mp3"},{"sentence":"media reports of the food shortages","translation":"گزارش رسانه ها از کمبود مواد غذایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607333.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('6be25aa6-c8bf-5a9f-a93d-b10d5bc6a609','828f0896-f4dd-536e-a99c-1cae7c721684',3,null,null,'spoken & written','an official document that carefully considers a particular subject',null,null,'یک سند رسمی که به دقت موضوع خاصی را در نظر می گیرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a recent report on child abuse","translation":"گزارش اخیر در مورد کودک آزاری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776518.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('83204aa9-1d7a-5311-b742-3fd0b77cc940','828f0896-f4dd-536e-a99c-1cae7c721684',4,null,null,'spoken & written','information that something has happened, which may or may not be true',null,null,'اطلاعاتی مبنی بر اینکه اتفاقی افتاده است، که ممکن است درست باشد یا نباشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Police received reports of a bomb threat at the airport at 11:28 p.m.","translation":"پلیس گزارش هایی مبنی بر تهدید بمب گذاری در فرودگاه در ساعت 11:28 بعد از ظهر دریافت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607340.mp3"},{"sentence":"Government officials have denied reports of rebel advances.","translation":"مقامات دولتی گزارش های مربوط به پیشروی شورشیان را رد کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001334.mp3"},{"sentence":"a report that he had been killed","translation":"گزارشی مبنی بر کشته شدن او","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607343.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('67363ff0-f3b5-5ed6-97b8-838e26e6263a','828f0896-f4dd-536e-a99c-1cae7c721684',5,null,null,'spoken & written','a written statement by teachers about a child’s work at school, which is sent to his or her parents',null,null,'بیانیه کتبی معلمان در مورد کار کودک در مدرسه که برای والدین او ارسال می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('84ea90fe-9a16-58ef-b61e-d3fe20292b79','828f0896-f4dd-536e-a99c-1cae7c721684',6,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who works for a particular manager',null,null,'کسی که برای یک مدیر خاص کار می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Only Gordon’s direct reports are attending the course.","translation":"فقط گزارش های مستقیم گوردون در این دوره حضور دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001813049.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d270b77f-18d6-5f5c-a092-4ebdcf0aee73','828f0896-f4dd-536e-a99c-1cae7c721684',7,null,null,'formal','the noise of an explosion or shot',null,null,'صدای انفجار یا شلیک','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a loud report","translation":"گزارشی با صدای بلند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776545.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('582eafce-2e4a-510e-a986-df373cb73358','528a6057-6a47-5564-be84-25efa61250ff',1,'news','اخبار','spoken & written','to give people information about recent events, especially in newspapers and on television and radio','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'گزارش دادن؛ گزارش کردن (بازار)؛ خبر دادن (در)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"This is Gavin Williams, reporting from the United Nations in New York.","translation":"این گاوین ویلیامز است که از سازمان ملل در نیویورک گزارش می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776559.mp3"},{"sentence":"We aim to report the news as fairly as possible.","translation":"هدف ما این است که اخبار را تا حد امکان منصفانه گزارش کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776562.mp3"},{"sentence":"The incident was widely reported in the national press.","translation":"این حادثه بازتاب گسترده ای در مطبوعات کشور داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607345.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Times sent her to Bangladesh to report on the floods.","translation":"تایمز او را به بنگلادش فرستاد تا در مورد سیل گزارش دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776565.mp3"},{"sentence":"Journalists in Cairo reported that seven people had been shot.","translation":"خبرنگاران در قاهره گزارش دادند که هفت نفر به ضرب گلوله کشته شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776568.mp3"},{"sentence":"Witnesses reported seeing three people flee the scene.","translation":"شاهدان گزارش دادند که سه نفر از صحنه فرار کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607350.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is reported that there has been an explosion.","translation":"گزارش شده است که یک انفجار رخ داده است.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,7),
('9c2b690c-964f-5a2a-b9dc-3fb6e1f9244b','528a6057-6a47-5564-be84-25efa61250ff',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be reported to be/do something','گزارش دادن؛ گزارش کردن (بازار)؛ خبر دادن (در)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('7a583b1a-91d5-5382-9c9e-1200949fa20b','528a6057-6a47-5564-be84-25efa61250ff',3,'job/work','شغل/کار','spoken & written','to tell someone about what has been happening, or what you are doing as part of your job','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'به کسی در مورد آنچه اتفاق افتاده است، یا کاری که به عنوان بخشی از کار خود انجام می دهید، بگویید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve asked him to come back next week and report on his progress.","translation":"من از او خواسته ام که هفته آینده برگردد و پیشرفت خود را گزارش کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776582.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7641caf0-6e1e-5d72-a653-96f1bf0757ed','528a6057-6a47-5564-be84-25efa61250ff',4,'public statement','بیانیه عمومی','spoken & written','to officially give information to the public','[ transitive ]',null,'به طور رسمی اطلاعات را در اختیار مردم قرار دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Doctors have reported a 13% increase in the number of people with heart disease.","translation":"پزشکان از افزایش 13 درصدی تعداد مبتلایان به بیماری قلبی خبر داده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776589.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('95a4a012-84d2-5ee7-a394-4436257a13fa','528a6057-6a47-5564-be84-25efa61250ff',5,'crime/accident','جنایت/حادثه','spoken & written','to tell the police or someone in authority that an accident or crime has happened','[ transitive ]',null,'به پلیس یا یکی از مقامات مسئول بگویید که یک حادثه یا جنایت اتفاق افتاده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’d like to report a theft.","translation":"من می خواهم یک سرقت را گزارش کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776596.mp3"},{"sentence":"All accidents must be reported to the safety officer.","translation":"تمام حوادث باید به افسر ایمنی گزارش شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776599.mp3"},{"sentence":"The plane was reported missing.","translation":"این هواپیما ناپدید شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776602.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('daea9021-0e30-5ce5-ab5a-189940038648','528a6057-6a47-5564-be84-25efa61250ff',6,'complain','شکایت کردن','spoken & written','to complain about someone to people in authority','[ transitive ]',null,'شکایت کردن از کسی به افراد مسئول','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Polish referee Ryszard Wojoik reported two Leeds United players for violent conduct.","translation":"داور لهستانی ریشارد ووجیک دو بازیکن لیدز یونایتد را به خاطر رفتار خشونت آمیز گزارش کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607360.mp3"},{"sentence":"Hadley’s drinking problem led co-workers to report him to the supervisor.","translation":"مشکل نوشیدن هدلی باعث شد که همکاران او را به سرپرست گزارش دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607363.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('c1212ab8-f4ec-5033-8f3f-a5277cf225b7','528a6057-6a47-5564-be84-25efa61250ff',7,'arrival','ورود','spoken & written','to go somewhere and officially state that you have arrived','[ intransitive ]',null,'به جایی بروید و رسماً اعلام کنید که وارد شده اید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"All visitors must report to the site office.","translation":"کلیه بازدیدکنندگان باید به دفتر سایت گزارش دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000776619.mp3"},{"sentence":"All soldiers were required to report for duty (= arrive and be ready for work ) on Friday.","translation":"همه سربازان موظف بودند روز جمعه برای انجام وظیفه (= رسیدن و آماده شدن برای کار) گزارش دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607364.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('564a9e8a-ee63-5843-8709-b5db11f76e01','528a6057-6a47-5564-be84-25efa61250ff',8,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'report sick','گزارش دادن؛ گزارش کردن (بازار)؛ خبر دادن (در)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('4682d5fc-e01e-569e-b3a0-737d762b9816','5f49fe3a-c9c4-5801-b21f-ae2417ceaeeb',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to save someone or something from a situation of danger or harm',null,null,'نجات دادن، نجات بخشیدن (از خطر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Survivors of the crash were rescued by helicopter.","translation":"بازماندگان این سانحه با هلیکوپتر نجات یافتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744075.mp3"},{"sentence":"She died trying to rescue her children from the blaze.","translation":"او در تلاش برای نجات فرزندانش از زیر آتش جان باخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607509.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('412f48ee-4aa2-543c-b922-3a000a25f874','2b0f9eb3-e424-5368-be88-c9c12dace733',1,null,null,'spoken & written','when someone or something is rescued from danger',null,null,'وقتی کسی یا چیزی از خطر نجات می یابد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a dramatic rescue A woman is in hospital following a dramatic rescue from her blazing flat.','a daring rescue The lifeboat crew has been honoured for a daring rescue on the Cleveland coast.','attempt/mount a rescue (= try to rescue someone ) The stormy conditions made it impossible to mount a rescue.','a rescue attempt/effort One fire fighter was severely burned in the rescue attempt.','a rescue operation/mission A major rescue operation was launched yesterday after two divers were reported missing.','a rescue worker Rescue workers are searching through the rubble for survivors.','a rescue team He was still conscious when the rescue team arrived.','a rescue helicopter/boat/ship A rescue helicopter is on its way.','a rescue plan/package (= plan to save a company, economy etc that is in trouble ) They drew up a rescue plan that involved restructuring the firm.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a daring rescue at sea","translation":"نجات جسورانه در دریا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744094.mp3"},{"sentence":"Storms delayed the rescue of the crash victims.","translation":"طوفان نجات قربانیان سقوط هواپیما را به تاخیر انداخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607512.mp3"},{"sentence":"Rescue workers arrived at the scene two hours later.","translation":"نیروهای امدادی دو ساعت بعد در محل حاضر شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607515.mp3"},{"sentence":"The rescue operation proved successful.","translation":"عملیات نجات موفقیت آمیز بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001877103.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('9fe8e46a-98af-5626-976d-ad8e281c9e50','2b0f9eb3-e424-5368-be88-c9c12dace733',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'come to the/somebody’s rescue',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a dramatic rescue A woman is in hospital following a dramatic rescue from her blazing flat.','a daring rescue The lifeboat crew has been honoured for a daring rescue on the Cleveland coast.','attempt/mount a rescue (= try to rescue someone ) The stormy conditions made it impossible to mount a rescue.','a rescue attempt/effort One fire fighter was severely burned in the rescue attempt.','a rescue operation/mission A major rescue operation was launched yesterday after two divers were reported missing.','a rescue worker Rescue workers are searching through the rubble for survivors.','a rescue team He was still conscious when the rescue team arrived.','a rescue helicopter/boat/ship A rescue helicopter is on its way.','a rescue plan/package (= plan to save a company, economy etc that is in trouble ) They drew up a rescue plan that involved restructuring the firm.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('53416d1b-9e77-543b-95d9-3b82262abe6c','dc70e093-650b-5a49-9790-8bbeb0b2014f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to officially announce that you have decided to leave your job or an organization',null,null,'استعفا دادن، کناره‌گیری کردن (از پست)؛ تسلیم شدن (به سرنوشت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['resign your post/position/office He later resigned his post as Minister of Energy.','resign your seat (= announce that you will no longer be a member of a parliament, be on a committee etc ) A majority of voters think he should resign his seat in Congress.','resign the presidency Richard Nixon resigned the presidency in 1974.','resign your chairmanship Mr Hunt announced that he has resigned his chairmanship of the committee.','resign your membership He recently resigned his membership of the National Rifle Association.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She resigned from the government last week.","translation":"او هفته گذشته از دولت استعفا داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001625950.mp3"},{"sentence":"He resigned as governor of Punjab in August.","translation":"او در ماه اوت از فرمانداری پنجاب استعفا داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001773256.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tom has since resigned his membership of the golf club.","translation":"تام از آن زمان از عضویت خود در باشگاه گلف استعفا داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001625953.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('659a6a3f-38f5-5fec-bf8f-8820e4b907d8','dc70e093-650b-5a49-9790-8bbeb0b2014f',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'resign yourself to (doing) something','استعفا دادن، کناره‌گیری کردن (از پست)؛ تسلیم شدن (به سرنوشت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['resign your post/position/office He later resigned his post as Minister of Energy.','resign your seat (= announce that you will no longer be a member of a parliament, be on a committee etc ) A majority of voters think he should resign his seat in Congress.','resign the presidency Richard Nixon resigned the presidency in 1974.','resign your chairmanship Mr Hunt announced that he has resigned his chairmanship of the committee.','resign your membership He recently resigned his membership of the National Rifle Association.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('12f4cb30-548c-5c82-bb81-5126d07ca924','6a4b93c1-a8ac-567b-907f-5f55ac075e9d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to stop yourself from having something that you like very much or doing something that you want to do','[ intransitive, transitive usually in negatives ]',null,'مقاومت کردن، مقابله کردن (با)؛ اکراه (تأکید)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['resist the temptation to do something He resisted the temptation to look back.','resist the urge/impulse to do something Bob resisted the urge to touch her hand.','resist the lure of something (= resist its attractive quality ) Bond could never resist the lure of a beautiful woman.','resist a challenge Mr Taylor is a man who cannot resist a challenge.','cannot resist (doing) something I couldn''t resist teasing him.','be unable to resist (doing) something He was unable to resist the temptation to smoke.','hard/difficult to resist The temptation to follow them was hard to resist.','impossible to resist The urge to give him a hug was almost impossible to resist.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I just can’t resist chocolate.","translation":"من فقط نمی توانم در برابر شکلات مقاومت کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744984.mp3"},{"sentence":"She can never resist buying new shoes.","translation":"او هرگز نمی تواند در برابر خرید کفش های جدید مقاومت کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744985.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s hard to resist an invitation like that.","translation":"مقاومت در برابر چنین دعوتی سخت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744988.mp3"},{"sentence":"She resisted the temptation to laugh.","translation":"او در برابر وسوسه خندیدن مقاومت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744991.mp3"},{"sentence":"They only wanted 3 dollars for it, so how could I resist?","translation":"آنها فقط 3 دلار برای آن می خواستند، پس چگونه می توانستم مقاومت کنم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001625986.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('a1b24002-c0d6-55b3-ad93-113e5b6743ed','6a4b93c1-a8ac-567b-907f-5f55ac075e9d',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to try to prevent a change from happening, or prevent yourself from being forced to do something','[ transitive ]',null,'تلاش برای جلوگیری از وقوع یک تغییر، یا جلوگیری از مجبور شدن خود به انجام کاری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He resisted pressure to resign.","translation":"او در برابر فشار برای استعفا مقاومت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744972.mp3"},{"sentence":"For months the company has resisted changing its accounts system.","translation":"برای ماه ها این شرکت در برابر تغییر سیستم حساب های خود مقاومت کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001625992.mp3"},{"sentence":"The proposal was strongly resisted by the police.","translation":"این پیشنهاد با مخالفت شدید پلیس روبرو شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001625995.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('76a41214-ceb1-5d8f-8be6-4af0f5b33f3f','6a4b93c1-a8ac-567b-907f-5f55ac075e9d',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to use force to stop something from happening','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'استفاده از زور برای جلوگیری از وقوع چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Demonstrators violently resisted attempts to remove them from the building.","translation":"تظاهرکنندگان به شدت در برابر تلاش برای خارج کردن آنها از ساختمان مقاومت کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744977.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was charged with trying to resist arrest .","translation":"او به تلاش برای مقاومت در برابر بازداشت متهم شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001625998.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('04cda5d5-3f58-51cd-9a5a-06188074e1ae','6a4b93c1-a8ac-567b-907f-5f55ac075e9d',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to not be changed or harmed by something','[ transitive ]',null,'از چیزی تغییر یا آسیب نبینند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"your ability to resist infection","translation":"توانایی شما برای مقاومت در برابر عفونت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000744996.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('f2b2ebbd-7348-5998-afec-4601873b448f','040e55ce-a071-5124-a799-7b6b94956766',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a place where a lot of people go for holidays','[ countable ]',null,'تفرجگاه، تفریحگاه؛ پناهگاه (پناه بردن)؛ تفرجگاه (آب)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a tourist resort There are plans to turn the town into a tourist resort.','a seaside/beach resort We stayed in a relaxed beach resort on the east coast.','a mountain resort mountain resorts in Colorado','a lakeside resort the popular lakeside resort of Lake Como','a holiday resort Benidorm is a terrific holiday resort.','a ski resort The lack of snow is causing problems for ski resorts.','a health resort We booked ourselves into a health resort for a weekend of pure indulgence.','a popular resort The popular seaside resort of Brighton is 40 minutes away.','a lively resort It is a lively resort with plenty of bars and cafés.','a bustling resort (= lively and full of people ) The hotel is right in the middle of this bustling resort.','a fashionable resort Hastings was a once fashionable resort.','a resort town/area/centre They''re only a five minute stroll away from the main resort centre with all its bars, restaurants and nightlife.','a resort hotel There are plans for a major resort hotel and golf course to be built.','a resort complex (= a group of buildings, or a large building with many parts ) Club Hotel is part of a resort complex offering a range of facilities.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Aspen, a ski resort in Colorado","translation":"آسپن، یک پیست اسکی در کلرادو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001773284.mp3"},{"sentence":"Lagoon Reef is one of the best resort hotels.","translation":"Lagoon Reef یکی از بهترین هتل های تفریحی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001773285.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
