('c713c3d1-a8f8-5f8d-823a-404a92031fc3','c8eea3f4-a0a0-53e7-9457-d9ea43dca14e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to make known something that was previously secret or unknown',null,null,'آشکار کردن، افشا کردن (راز)؛ برملا کردن (حقیقت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He may be prosecuted for revealing secrets about the security agency.","translation":"او ممکن است به دلیل افشای اسرار در مورد آژانس امنیتی تحت تعقیب قرار گیرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001876996.mp3"},{"sentence":"a test that can reveal a teacher’s hidden skills","translation":"آزمونی که می تواند مهارت های پنهان معلم را آشکار کند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001994787.mp3"},{"sentence":"He revealed that he had been in prison twice before.","translation":"او فاش کرد که پیش از این دو بار در زندان بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001575072.mp3"},{"sentence":"The violinist revealed himself as a talented interpreter of classical music.","translation":"ویولونیست خود را به عنوان یک مترجم با استعداد موسیقی کلاسیک نشان داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001876997.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('4b5c1d9b-8b58-5489-9e9a-8cf432fe4011','c8eea3f4-a0a0-53e7-9457-d9ea43dca14e',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to show something that was previously hidden',null,null,'برای نشان دادن چیزی که قبلا پنهان شده بود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The curtain opened to reveal the grand prize.","translation":"پرده برای نشان دادن جایزه بزرگ باز شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001994788.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c8824a68-db29-5536-a1fc-2d0ae919f82d','0019b2dc-d4fe-5fa3-a2ff-0ab1337b5a72',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the time, especially on a television programme , when something that was previously secret or unknown is shown or made known, or when a changed person or thing is shown',null,null,'زمانی، به ویژه در یک برنامه تلویزیونی، زمانی که چیزی که قبلاً مخفی یا ناشناخته بود نشان داده می شود یا مشخص می شود، یا زمانی که شخص یا چیز تغییر یافته نشان داده می شود.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"After the garden makeover, it was time to bring the owners back for the big reveal.","translation":"پس از بازسازی باغ، زمان بازگرداندن مالکان برای نمایش بزرگ فرا رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00734.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('bb62f1b1-aa14-5706-9c51-041322688cad','42e9176e-efdd-5102-bc46-5c7ec613a560',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a careful examination of a situation or process','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'بازبینی، بررسی (وضعیت)؛ نقد (کتاب/فیلم)؛ مرور (درس)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['carry out a review ( also conduct a review formal ) No one has yet carried out a review of the system. Government officials are conducting a review of the law.','undertake a review (= start it and carry it out ) The department plans to undertake a spending review.','keep something under review (= continue to review it ) He recommended that the matter should be kept under review.','come up for review (= be reviewed after a particular period of time has ended ) His contract is coming up for review.','be subject to review formal (= may be reviewed or changed ) These prices are subject to review.','a major review We are conducting a major review of our procedures.','a thorough/comprehensive review Their conclusion is based on a comprehensive review of all the previous studies.','an extensive/wide-ranging review He is currently conducting a wide-ranging review of public spending.','a fundamental review (= that examines the most basic and important parts of something ) There have been calls for a fundamental review of our voting system.','an annual review There will be an annual review of your salary.','an independent review Their findings have been confirmed by a recent independent review.','an internal review (= one that an organization carries out on itself ) The Army is conducting an internal review.','judicial review (= examination by a judge ) The case is likely to go to judicial review.','a policy review The policy review proposed radical changes to the system.','a spending review Extra money was promised in last summer’s spending review.','a review body/committee/panel/board We will set up a pay review body for all staff.','a review process We cannot comment until the review process is over.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She sent us her review of the research.","translation":"او بررسی خود را از تحقیق برای ما ارسال کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622809.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company hired Bob to conduct an independent review of their workplace procedures.","translation":"این شرکت باب را برای بررسی مستقل رویه‌های محل کارشان استخدام کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000749488.mp3"},{"sentence":"the Teachers’ Pay Review Body","translation":"بدن بررسی حقوق معلمان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622816.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’re keeping this policy under review (= we are continuing to examine it ) .","translation":"ما این خط‌مشی را تحت بررسی قرار می‌دهیم (= به بررسی آن ادامه می‌دهیم).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622819.mp3"},{"sentence":"The policy comes up for review (= will be reviewed ) in April.","translation":"این خط‌مشی برای بررسی (= بررسی خواهد شد) در ماه آوریل ارائه می‌شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622810.mp3"},{"sentence":"All fees are subject to review (= may be reviewed ) .","translation":"همه هزینه ها قابل بررسی هستند (= ممکن است بازبینی شوند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622827.mp3"},{"sentence":"Mr Crowther asked for judicial review of the decision (= an examination of the decision by a judge ) .","translation":"آقای کروتر خواستار بررسی قضایی تصمیم (= بررسی تصمیم توسط قاضی) شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622832.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('b5415e9d-4d42-569f-8d91-35c10933643e','42e9176e-efdd-5102-bc46-5c7ec613a560',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an article in a newspaper or magazine that gives an opinion about a new book, play, film etc','[ countable ]',null,'مقاله ای در روزنامه یا مجله که در مورد یک کتاب، نمایشنامه، فیلم جدید و غیره نظر می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['carry out a review ( also conduct a review formal ) No one has yet carried out a review of the system. Government officials are conducting a review of the law.','undertake a review (= start it and carry it out ) The department plans to undertake a spending review.','keep something under review (= continue to review it ) He recommended that the matter should be kept under review.','come up for review (= be reviewed after a particular period of time has ended ) His contract is coming up for review.','be subject to review formal (= may be reviewed or changed ) These prices are subject to review.','a major review We are conducting a major review of our procedures.','a thorough/comprehensive review Their conclusion is based on a comprehensive review of all the previous studies.','an extensive/wide-ranging review He is currently conducting a wide-ranging review of public spending.','a fundamental review (= that examines the most basic and important parts of something ) There have been calls for a fundamental review of our voting system.','an annual review There will be an annual review of your salary.','an independent review Their findings have been confirmed by a recent independent review.','an internal review (= one that an organization carries out on itself ) The Army is conducting an internal review.','judicial review (= examination by a judge ) The case is likely to go to judicial review.','a policy review The policy review proposed radical changes to the system.','a spending review Extra money was promised in last summer’s spending review.','a review body/committee/panel/board We will set up a pay review body for all staff.','a review process We cannot comment until the review process is over.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a film review","translation":"نقد فیلم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000749498.mp3"},{"sentence":"The paper published a review of her book.","translation":"این روزنامه مروری بر کتاب او منتشر کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622840.mp3"},{"sentence":"The band’s new album has had very good reviews.","translation":"آلبوم جدید گروه نقدهای بسیار خوبی داشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622843.mp3"},{"sentence":"The film opened to rave reviews (= reviews that praised it a lot ) .","translation":"فیلم با نقدهای تحسین برانگیز باز شد (= نقدهایی که آن را بسیار تحسین کردند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622844.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('3204cdbe-d483-5758-a4b9-860b32382cd6','42e9176e-efdd-5102-bc46-5c7ec613a560',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the work of writing reviews for a newspaper or magazine','[ uncountable ]',null,'کار نوشتن نقد برای یک روزنامه یا مجله','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['carry out a review ( also conduct a review formal ) No one has yet carried out a review of the system. Government officials are conducting a review of the law.','undertake a review (= start it and carry it out ) The department plans to undertake a spending review.','keep something under review (= continue to review it ) He recommended that the matter should be kept under review.','come up for review (= be reviewed after a particular period of time has ended ) His contract is coming up for review.','be subject to review formal (= may be reviewed or changed ) These prices are subject to review.','a major review We are conducting a major review of our procedures.','a thorough/comprehensive review Their conclusion is based on a comprehensive review of all the previous studies.','an extensive/wide-ranging review He is currently conducting a wide-ranging review of public spending.','a fundamental review (= that examines the most basic and important parts of something ) There have been calls for a fundamental review of our voting system.','an annual review There will be an annual review of your salary.','an independent review Their findings have been confirmed by a recent independent review.','an internal review (= one that an organization carries out on itself ) The Army is conducting an internal review.','judicial review (= examination by a judge ) The case is likely to go to judicial review.','a policy review The policy review proposed radical changes to the system.','a spending review Extra money was promised in last summer’s spending review.','a review body/committee/panel/board We will set up a pay review body for all staff.','a review process We cannot comment until the review process is over.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The book was sent to the press for review in September.","translation":"این کتاب در شهریور ماه برای بررسی به مطبوعات فرستاده شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000749504.mp3"},{"sentence":"The journal receives review copies (= free copies to review ) of most new software products.","translation":"مجله نسخه‌های بررسی (= نسخه‌های رایگان برای بررسی) اکثر محصولات نرم‌افزاری جدید را دریافت می‌کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622849.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('06823bc6-3dfa-5a54-bd32-c1871c8bbfbe','42e9176e-efdd-5102-bc46-5c7ec613a560',4,null,null,'spoken & written','a report on a series of events or a period of time, that mentions the most important parts','[ countable ]',null,'گزارشی از یک سری رویدادها یا یک دوره زمانی که مهمترین بخشها را ذکر می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['carry out a review ( also conduct a review formal ) No one has yet carried out a review of the system. Government officials are conducting a review of the law.','undertake a review (= start it and carry it out ) The department plans to undertake a spending review.','keep something under review (= continue to review it ) He recommended that the matter should be kept under review.','come up for review (= be reviewed after a particular period of time has ended ) His contract is coming up for review.','be subject to review formal (= may be reviewed or changed ) These prices are subject to review.','a major review We are conducting a major review of our procedures.','a thorough/comprehensive review Their conclusion is based on a comprehensive review of all the previous studies.','an extensive/wide-ranging review He is currently conducting a wide-ranging review of public spending.','a fundamental review (= that examines the most basic and important parts of something ) There have been calls for a fundamental review of our voting system.','an annual review There will be an annual review of your salary.','an independent review Their findings have been confirmed by a recent independent review.','an internal review (= one that an organization carries out on itself ) The Army is conducting an internal review.','judicial review (= examination by a judge ) The case is likely to go to judicial review.','a policy review The policy review proposed radical changes to the system.','a spending review Extra money was promised in last summer’s spending review.','a review body/committee/panel/board We will set up a pay review body for all staff.','a review process We cannot comment until the review process is over.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a review of the year","translation":"بررسی سال","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001994795.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('286fcb9e-b28c-5f33-a9c1-2fc9a0f363b9','42e9176e-efdd-5102-bc46-5c7ec613a560',5,null,null,'spoken & written','an official show of the army , navy etc so that a king , president , or officer of high rank can see them','[ countable ]',null,'نمایش رسمی ارتش، نیروی دریایی و غیره به طوری که یک پادشاه، رئیس جمهور یا افسر عالی رتبه بتواند آنها را ببیند.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['carry out a review ( also conduct a review formal ) No one has yet carried out a review of the system. Government officials are conducting a review of the law.','undertake a review (= start it and carry it out ) The department plans to undertake a spending review.','keep something under review (= continue to review it ) He recommended that the matter should be kept under review.','come up for review (= be reviewed after a particular period of time has ended ) His contract is coming up for review.','be subject to review formal (= may be reviewed or changed ) These prices are subject to review.','a major review We are conducting a major review of our procedures.','a thorough/comprehensive review Their conclusion is based on a comprehensive review of all the previous studies.','an extensive/wide-ranging review He is currently conducting a wide-ranging review of public spending.','a fundamental review (= that examines the most basic and important parts of something ) There have been calls for a fundamental review of our voting system.','an annual review There will be an annual review of your salary.','an independent review Their findings have been confirmed by a recent independent review.','an internal review (= one that an organization carries out on itself ) The Army is conducting an internal review.','judicial review (= examination by a judge ) The case is likely to go to judicial review.','a policy review The policy review proposed radical changes to the system.','a spending review Extra money was promised in last summer’s spending review.','a review body/committee/panel/board We will set up a pay review body for all staff.','a review process We cannot comment until the review process is over.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a naval review","translation":"بررسی نیروی دریایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000749512.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ee88a9a7-54ae-5b9c-8a68-349ff6c681a1','8bae99ec-5e84-5676-b3f8-7c10de56ff29',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to examine , consider , and judge a situation or process carefully in order to see if changes are necessary',null,null,'بازبینی کردن؛ نقد کردن (اثر)؛ مرور کردن (درس)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We will review your situation and decide how we can help you.","translation":"ما وضعیت شما را بررسی می کنیم و تصمیم می گیریم که چگونه می توانیم به شما کمک کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000749530.mp3"},{"sentence":"The decision will be reviewed by the Supreme Court.","translation":"این تصمیم در دیوان عالی کشور بررسی خواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622855.mp3"},{"sentence":"The team manager’s position will be reviewed at the end of the season.","translation":"پست سرمربی تیم در پایان فصل بررسی خواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622856.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b7de5753-9129-53f7-a9de-02fe824db0c9','8bae99ec-5e84-5676-b3f8-7c10de56ff29',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to write a short article describing and judging a new book, play, film etc',null,null,'نوشتن یک مقاله کوتاه در توصیف و داوری یک کتاب، نمایشنامه، فیلم جدید و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Bradman will review the best of the new children’s books.","translation":"برادمن بهترین کتاب‌های جدید کودکان را بررسی خواهد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000749536.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('a4ed5cba-eda6-5501-b878-64e470783c4f','8bae99ec-5e84-5676-b3f8-7c10de56ff29',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to look again at something you have studied, such as notes, reports etc',null,null,'برای نگاه کردن دوباره به چیزی که مطالعه کرده اید، مانند یادداشت ها، گزارش ها و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f20fbc54-fd46-52c4-aea9-517ca844e2a4','8bae99ec-5e84-5676-b3f8-7c10de56ff29',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to examine and describe the most important parts of a series of events or period of time',null,null,'برای بررسی و توصیف مهمترین بخشهای یک سری رویدادها یا دوره های زمانی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a journalist who will review the events of the past six months","translation":"روزنامه نگاری که رویدادهای شش ماه گذشته را مرور خواهد کرد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001994799.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('62436476-129b-54f1-83f3-88852a967fff','8bae99ec-5e84-5676-b3f8-7c10de56ff29',5,null,null,'spoken & written','to officially watch a group of soldiers , ships etc at a military show',null,null,'برای تماشای رسمی گروهی از سربازان، کشتی ها و غیره در یک نمایش نظامی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The president will review the soldiers on parade.","translation":"رئیس جمهور از سربازان حاضر در رژه بازدید خواهد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000749544.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('5a059aad-265a-5153-b6a5-457b195955a1','e4209117-696a-5fe9-8920-33fb7c120b27',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something that you get because you have done something good or helpful or have worked hard','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'پاداش، عوض؛ جایزه (مالی)؛ پاداش (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['great/big/high The rewards for those who invested at the right time are high. Some athletes took drugs because the rewards were great and they thought they could get away with it.','little reward They have to work very hard for very little reward.','financial/economic reward ( also monetary reward formal ) It’s a difficult job, but the financial rewards are considerable. I’m not doing it for monetary reward.','material rewards (= money or possessions that you get ) They think money and material rewards are more important than quality of life.','tangible rewards (= things that are obviously worth having ) The prize motivates people by offering them the prospect of a tangible reward for their efforts.','rich rewards (= great rewards ) Top athletes can expect rich rewards if they win.','personal reward I admire people who help the poor for no personal reward.','get/receive your reward If you work hard, you will get your reward.','reap rewards (= get them ) She is now reaping the rewards of all her hard work.','bring rewards (= cause someone to get rewards ) Winning the title brings huge financial rewards.','deserve a reward The team have worked really hard and deserve some reward.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The school has a system of rewards and punishments to encourage good behaviour.","translation":"مدرسه سیستمی از پاداش و تنبیه برای تشویق رفتار خوب دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622600.mp3"},{"sentence":"Parents often give their children rewards for passing exams.","translation":"والدین اغلب برای موفقیت در امتحانات به فرزندانشان جایزه می دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001345.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('2e269395-c6a4-5fb5-91ea-7c17ec8e225e','e4209117-696a-5fe9-8920-33fb7c120b27',2,null,null,'spoken & written','money that is offered to people for helping the police to solve a crime or catch a criminal','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'پولی که برای کمک به پلیس برای حل یک جنایت یا دستگیری یک مجرم به مردم ارائه می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A reward of $20,000 has been offered.","translation":"20000 دلار جایزه در نظر گرفته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770210.mp3"},{"sentence":"a reward for information leading to the capture of the murderers","translation":"جایزه برای اطلاعاتی که منجر به دستگیری قاتلان شود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770213.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('bd8cdedc-8579-575e-832d-425333876632','7f1b684c-9f67-5b5a-ae26-0de532b160ed',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to give something to someone because they have done something good or helpful or have worked for it',null,null,'دادن چیزی به کسی چون کاری خوب یا مفید انجام داده یا برای آن کار کرده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The club’s directors rewarded him with a free season ticket.","translation":"مدیران باشگاه با یک بلیط فصل رایگان به او پاداش دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622627.mp3"},{"sentence":"She wanted to reward the cleaners for their efforts.","translation":"او می خواست به نظافتچی ها برای تلاش هایشان پاداش دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622630.mp3"},{"sentence":"He gave the children some chocolate to reward them for behaving well.","translation":"او مقداری شکلات به بچه ها داد تا به خاطر رفتار خوبشان جایزه بدهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622631.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
