('d4a7d617-894a-5d02-bc22-a46adf192e28','4efd359b-623e-58f0-a6e6-dc84d33a833b',6,null,null,'spoken & written','the piece of white rubber where the pitcher (= person who throws the ball ) stands in a baseball game','[ countable ]',null,'تکه لاستیک سفید که در آن پارچ (= شخصی که توپ را پرتاب می کند) در یک بازی بیسبال ایستاده است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('ffd6711b-3771-5127-ad4e-64f8b92c46ca','ff799cad-80fc-5248-961a-c8f2e31af754',1,'not in danger','در خطر نیست','spoken & written','when someone or something is safe from danger or harm','[ uncountable ]',null,'ایمنی، ایمنی؛ ایمنی (شغلی)؛ ایمنی (بدن)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['public safety The police must put public safety first.','personal safety She didn’t seem to care about her own personal safety.','road safety (= for people driving and walking on roads ) Extra lighting would improve road safety in this area.','food safety (= how safe food is to eat ) New food safety laws say that sandwiches for sale in shops must be kept refrigerated.','safety standards (= official rules designed to make something safe ) He claims safety standards on ferries are still not high enough.','safety regulations (= rules designed to make something safe ) She was sold an electric fire that broke all the safety regulations.','safety equipment Your employer should provide the necessary safety equipment.','a safety measure (= something that is done to make something safe ) New safety measures have been introduced after two horses died in last year’s race.','a safety hazard (= something which may be dangerous ) The firing range is poorly designed and poses a significant safety hazard.','a safety record (= figures showing how safe or unsafe something has been in the past ) The aircraft has a good safety record.','health and safety (= things that are done to prevent people becoming ill or having accidents during an activity ) The Agency’s function is to promote health and safety at work.','improve safety New plans have been announced to improve safety on the railways.','ensure/guarantee somebody’s safety There were few laws or regulations to ensure the safety of workers.','fear for somebody’s safety (= be afraid that they will not be safe ) They fear for the safety of relatives they have left behind.','for your own safety He had been kept in custody for his own safety.','for safety reasons ( also for safety’s sake ) (= in order to make something safe ) For safety reasons visitors won’t be able to go down the tunnels.','as a safety precaution (= in order to prevent accidents from happening, when this is possible but not very likely ) A fence was put around the lake as a safety precaution.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"measures to improve the health and safety of employees","translation":"اقداماتی برای بهبود سلامت و ایمنی کارکنان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001563712.mp3"},{"sentence":"We were able to watch the lions in complete safety.","translation":"ما توانستیم شیرها را در امنیت کامل تماشا کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000740203.mp3"},{"sentence":"For safety, always climb with a partner.","translation":"برای ایمنی، همیشه با یک شریک صعود کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001976425.mp3"},{"sentence":"You shouldn’t travel alone, for safety’s sake .","translation":"به خاطر امنیت نباید به تنهایی سفر کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020207.mp3"},{"sentence":"For your own safety , please do not smoke inside the plane.","translation":"برای ایمنی خود لطفا در داخل هواپیما سیگار نکشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000740215.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('c20f078d-dbb2-5198-8cf8-72900cfa8f29','ff799cad-80fc-5248-961a-c8f2e31af754',2,'harmful/not harmful','مضر/غیر مضر','spoken & written','how safe something is to use, do etc','[ uncountable ]',null,'استفاده، انجام دادن چیزی و غیره چقدر ایمن است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['public safety The police must put public safety first.','personal safety She didn’t seem to care about her own personal safety.','road safety (= for people driving and walking on roads ) Extra lighting would improve road safety in this area.','food safety (= how safe food is to eat ) New food safety laws say that sandwiches for sale in shops must be kept refrigerated.','safety standards (= official rules designed to make something safe ) He claims safety standards on ferries are still not high enough.','safety regulations (= rules designed to make something safe ) She was sold an electric fire that broke all the safety regulations.','safety equipment Your employer should provide the necessary safety equipment.','a safety measure (= something that is done to make something safe ) New safety measures have been introduced after two horses died in last year’s race.','a safety hazard (= something which may be dangerous ) The firing range is poorly designed and poses a significant safety hazard.','a safety record (= figures showing how safe or unsafe something has been in the past ) The aircraft has a good safety record.','health and safety (= things that are done to prevent people becoming ill or having accidents during an activity ) The Agency’s function is to promote health and safety at work.','improve safety New plans have been announced to improve safety on the railways.','ensure/guarantee somebody’s safety There were few laws or regulations to ensure the safety of workers.','fear for somebody’s safety (= be afraid that they will not be safe ) They fear for the safety of relatives they have left behind.','for your own safety He had been kept in custody for his own safety.','for safety reasons ( also for safety’s sake ) (= in order to make something safe ) For safety reasons visitors won’t be able to go down the tunnels.','as a safety precaution (= in order to prevent accidents from happening, when this is possible but not very likely ) A fence was put around the lake as a safety precaution.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Campaigners have challenged the safety of genetically modified foods.","translation":"کمپین‌ها ایمنی غذاهای اصلاح‌شده ژنتیکی را به چالش کشیده‌اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001563718.mp3"},{"sentence":"The device meets safety standards.","translation":"دستگاه مطابق با استانداردهای ایمنی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000740225.mp3"},{"sentence":"Lower speed limits are part of a new road safety campaign.","translation":"محدودیت سرعت کمتر بخشی از یک کمپین جدید ایمنی جاده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000740229.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
