 For safety reasons visitors won’t be able to go down the tunnels.','as a safety precaution (= in order to prevent accidents from happening, when this is possible but not very likely ) A fence was put around the lake as a safety precaution.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('b8a5bead-40ba-5f48-90b5-f4021dfa46e8','ff799cad-80fc-5248-961a-c8f2e31af754',4,'safe place','مکان امن','spoken & written','a place where you are safe from danger','[ uncountable ]',null,'مکانی که در آن از خطر در امان باشید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Thirty thousand people fled to the safety of the capital.","translation":"سی هزار نفر به امن پایتخت گریختند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00754.mp3"},{"sentence":"Firefighters led the children to safety.","translation":"آتش نشانان بچه ها را به محل امن هدایت کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001776254.mp3"},{"sentence":"They reached safety seconds before the bomb went off.","translation":"آنها چند ثانیه قبل از انفجار بمب به ایمنی رسیدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001563724.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('84c9d413-80ab-5f9c-805c-a9dcd7f52143','ff799cad-80fc-5248-961a-c8f2e31af754',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'there is safety in numbers','ایمنی، ایمنی؛ ایمنی (شغلی)؛ ایمنی (بدن)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
