('bde54301-dab7-5320-8d8f-9cd5f79b8a8e','82f32e65-27a4-5a37-800e-05329775c74a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to make a loud high noise with your voice because you are hurt , frightened , excited etc','[ intransitive ]',null,'جیغ زدن؛ فریاد کشیدن (ترس)؛ فریاد (طوطی)',array['shriek']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['scream loudly I just screamed as loudly as I could.','scream wildly (= in a loud and uncontrolled way ) Poor George, screaming wildly, was carried upstairs by his father.','scream hysterically (= in a completely uncontrolled way ) Some of the girls started screaming hysterically.','scream with laughter/delight She threw her head back and screamed with laughter.','scream in/with pain We could hear her screaming in pain.','scream in terror/agony etc He screamed in fear and panic, and banged frantically on the door.','scream your head off (= scream a lot ) At least the idiot wasn’t panicking and screaming his head off.','scream blue murder informal (= scream very loudly with fear or anger ) She flew into a rage and screamed blue murder at him.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"After the first few shots, people started screaming.","translation":"پس از اولین شلیک، مردم شروع به جیغ زدن کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000721726.mp3"},{"sentence":"a screaming baby","translation":"یک بچه جیغ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000721727.mp3"},{"sentence":"She jumped to her feet, screaming in terror.","translation":"او از ترس جیغ می کشید و از جایش بلند شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611055.mp3"},{"sentence":"The children were screaming with laughter .","translation":"بچه ها از خنده جیغ می زدند .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611056.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was screaming her head off (= screaming a lot ) .","translation":"سرش را فریاد می زد (= بسیار فریاد می زد ) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611060.mp3"},{"sentence":"She began to scream blue murder (= scream very loudly ) .","translation":"او شروع به فریاد زدن آبی قتل (= فریاد بسیار بلند) کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611065.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was dragged kicking and screaming to a nearby van.","translation":"او را با لگد و فریاد به ون نزدیکی کشیده بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611070.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('1a00983b-f40c-5a6b-b34b-e18f9df275ed','82f32e65-27a4-5a37-800e-05329775c74a',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to shout something in a very loud high voice because you are angry or frightened','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'به دلیل عصبانیت یا ترسیدن چیزی را با صدای بسیار بلند فریاد بزنید',array['yell']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['scream loudly I just screamed as loudly as I could.','scream wildly (= in a loud and uncontrolled way ) Poor George, screaming wildly, was carried upstairs by his father.','scream hysterically (= in a completely uncontrolled way ) Some of the girls started screaming hysterically.','scream with laughter/delight She threw her head back and screamed with laughter.','scream in/with pain We could hear her screaming in pain.','scream in terror/agony etc He screamed in fear and panic, and banged frantically on the door.','scream your head off (= scream a lot ) At least the idiot wasn’t panicking and screaming his head off.','scream blue murder informal (= scream very loudly with fear or anger ) She flew into a rage and screamed blue murder at him.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘Get out!’ she screamed.","translation":"فریاد زد: «برو بیرون!»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000721741.mp3"},{"sentence":"He screamed out her name.","translation":"نام او را فریاد زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611074.mp3"},{"sentence":"I screamed for help.","translation":"جیغ زدم کمک خواستم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000721744.mp3"},{"sentence":"He screamed at her to go away.","translation":"او فریاد زد که برود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000721747.mp3"},{"sentence":"The crowd continued to scream abuse at him.","translation":"جمعیت همچنان به او فریاد می زدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611075.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('7d229670-312a-51e0-a75d-3b40c34ddc4e','82f32e65-27a4-5a37-800e-05329775c74a',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to make a very loud high noise','[ intransitive ]',null,'برای ایجاد صدای بسیار بلند بالا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['scream loudly I just screamed as loudly as I could.','scream wildly (= in a loud and uncontrolled way ) Poor George, screaming wildly, was carried upstairs by his father.','scream hysterically (= in a completely uncontrolled way ) Some of the girls started screaming hysterically.','scream with laughter/delight She threw her head back and screamed with laughter.','scream in/with pain We could hear her screaming in pain.','scream in terror/agony etc He screamed in fear and panic, and banged frantically on the door.','scream your head off (= scream a lot ) At least the idiot wasn’t panicking and screaming his head off.','scream blue murder informal (= scream very loudly with fear or anger ) She flew into a rage and screamed blue murder at him.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The police car approached, its siren screaming.","translation":"ماشین پلیس نزدیک شد، آژیرش جیغ می زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000721755.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('3d251866-0d49-5111-bb6c-8454e007da2f','e8e4139e-4407-5065-a8c9-3683877c1279',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a loud high sound that you make with your voice because you are hurt, frightened, excited etc',null,null,'صدای بلند بلندی که با صدای خود تولید می کنید زیرا آسیب دیده اید، ترسیده اید، هیجان زده هستید و غیره',array['shriek']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a loud scream Suddenly I heard a loud scream.','a shrill/piercing/high-pitched scream (= with a very high sound ) The sound of gunfire mingled with the shrill screams of the injured.','a bloodcurdling scream (= very frightening ) With a blood-curdling scream, he threw himself at Paul.','a terrified scream (= by someone who is terrified ) I let out a terrified scream and scuttled down the stairs.','a terrible scream (= by someone suffering great pain or fear ) We were woken late that night by the most terrible screams.','a little scream Mrs Wood gave a little scream.','a muffled/stifled scream (= made quieter, for example by putting a hand over someone’s mouth ) No one heard her muffled screams.','let out a scream He let out a piercing scream.','give a scream She gave a scream of delight.','a scream of laughter/delight We could hear the children’s screams of laughter.','a scream of pain/terror/agony My screams of terror awoke my parents.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We heard screams coming from the flat.","translation":"صدای فریادهایی از آپارتمان شنیدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000721776.mp3"},{"sentence":"She saw the knife and let out a scream .","translation":"چاقو را دید و فریاد کشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611079.mp3"},{"sentence":"He fell back with a scream of terror and pain.","translation":"با فریاد وحشت و درد به عقب افتاد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000721779.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
