0724123.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('8b0ea399-0f62-5269-a700-f59f514697e6','0ffb518b-0a83-51ba-b0a9-e19e0e08fc62',1,'looking','نگاه کردن','spoken & written','to try to find someone or something by looking very carefully','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'جستجو کردن؛ گشتن (در)؛ تفتیش کردن (جامه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['search something carefully We searched the whole house carefully, but didn’t find anything.','search something thoroughly They searched the garden thoroughly.','search frantically/desperately (= in a hurried way, because you feel very worried ) Panic-stricken parents frantically searched for their children.','search high and low (= search everywhere ) We searched high and low for him, but couldn’t find him.','search something from top to bottom (= search all the rooms in a building ) They searched the house from top to bottom.','search in vain He searched in vain for a means of escape.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It was too dark to search further.","translation":"هوا برای جستجوی بیشتر تاریک بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580746.mp3"},{"sentence":"The area was thoroughly searched .","translation":"منطقه به طور کامل جستجو شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580747.mp3"},{"sentence":"An RAF plane searched for the missing men.","translation":"یک هواپیمای RAF به جستجوی مردان گم شده پرداخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000724140.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve searched high and low (= everywhere ) for my glasses.","translation":"من بالا و پایین (= همه جا) را برای عینکم جستجو کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000724143.mp3"},{"sentence":"Detectives are searching the yard for clues.","translation":"کارآگاهان در حال جستجوی حیاط برای سرنخ هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000724146.mp3"},{"sentence":"Alice bent to search through a heap of clothes.","translation":"آلیس خم شد تا در میان