('27b63f75-c6d4-5664-87ce-e34753847e8a','29471e74-c07e-58ad-8dfc-9b704f22f572',1,'time of year','زمان سال','spoken & written','one of the main periods into which a year is divided , each of which has a particular type of weather . The seasons are spring , summer , autumn , and winter','[ countable ]',null,'فصل، فصل‌های (سال)؛ فصل (کشت)؛ فصل (ماه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the effect on plants as the seasons start to change","translation":"با شروع تغییر فصول روی گیاهان تأثیر می گذارد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00767.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ade78189-b31a-50e8-b431-3e2334177eb8','29471e74-c07e-58ad-8dfc-9b704f22f572',2,'usual time for something','زمان معمول برای چیزی','spoken & written','a period of time in a year during which a particular activity takes place, or during which something usually happens','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'دوره زمانی در یک سال که در طی آن فعالیت خاصی انجام می شود یا معمولاً در طی آن چیزی اتفاق می افتد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a good/successful season The club has had another successful season.','a poor/disappointing season It''s been a disappointing season for Arsenal.','the football/cricket etc season The football season will be starting soon.','the hunting/shooting/fishing season Autumn was traditionally the hunting season.','the holiday season (= when most people go on holiday ) The roads are always busy during the holiday season.','the tourist season (= when a lot of tourists visit an area ) It''s almost impossible to get a hotel room in the tourist season.','the rainy/wet/dry season (= when the weather is rainy, wet, dry etc ) In the rainy season, roads became a quagmire.','the growing/planting etc season (= for growing or planting crops ) The growing season is short in these mountainous areas.','the festive season (= the period around Christmas ) More people are choosing to go abroad for the festive season.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the first game of the season","translation":"اولین بازی فصل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580813.mp3"},{"sentence":"the end of the football season","translation":"پایان فصل فوتبال","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001986019.mp3"},{"sentence":"The racing season starts in June.","translation":"فصل مسابقه از ژوئن شروع می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580817.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some footpaths are closed during the shooting season.","translation":"برخی از مسیرهای پیاده روی در فصل تیراندازی بسته هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580816.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was caught fishing out of season.","translation":"او در حال ماهیگیری خارج از فصل گرفتار شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001779222.mp3"},{"sentence":"The season for strawberries (= when they are available to buy ) usually starts in early June.","translation":"فصل توت فرنگی (= زمانی که برای خرید در دسترس است) معمولا از اوایل ژوئن شروع می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001986022.mp3"},{"sentence":"African rivers turn to hard mud during the dry season.","translation":"رودخانه های آفریقا در فصل خشک به گل سخت تبدیل می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580833.mp3"},{"sentence":"The planting season is in spring, with harvest in the fall.","translation":"فصل کاشت در بهار و برداشت در پاییز است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580834.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('e95e25d2-b0eb-560a-9db9-73a10a0c63b9','29471e74-c07e-58ad-8dfc-9b704f22f572',3,'holiday','تعطیلات','spoken & written','the time of the year when most people take their holidays','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'زمانی از سال که اکثر مردم تعطیلات خود را می گذرانند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"There are two boat trips a day, more in high season.","translation":"روزی دو سفر با قایق وجود دارد که بیشتر در فصل پرآب وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580843.mp3"},{"sentence":"An off-season break costs £114.","translation":"هزینه استراحت خارج از فصل 114 پوند است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580849.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s quieter out of season.","translation":"خارج از فصل ساکت تر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001779225.mp3"},{"sentence":"We arrived at the height of the tourist season (= the busiest time ) .","translation":"به اوج فصل گردشگری (= شلوغ ترین زمان) رسیدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580854.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
