('72bd13d9-f6df-5526-ab2d-7071c2463a46','737701a6-a868-560d-b1d0-ddc181b660d5',1,'dark shape','شکل تیره','spoken & written','the dark shape that someone or something makes on a surface when they are between that surface and the light','[ countable ]',null,'سایه، سایه (شخص)؛ سایه (حس)؛ سایه (خرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['cast/throw a shadow (= make it appear ) The building cast a shadow across the narrow street.','a shadow falls somewhere (= appears on something ) The footsteps came closer, and a shadow fell across the table.','the shadows lengthen (= get longer, as it gets later in the day ) Already the shadows were lengthening.','a dark/black shadow She saw the dark shadow of a man in the doorway.','a long shadow Long shadows stretched across the grass from the apple trees.','flickering shadows (= shadows that move about quickly ) Candles cast strange flickering shadows on the walls.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the long dark shadow of an old oak tree","translation":"سایه تاریک طولانی یک درخت بلوط پیر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000709315.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was hot, and we decided to walk in the shadow of the wall (= along the wall, where its shadow would fall ) .","translation":"هوا گرم بود و ما تصمیم گرفتیم در سایه دیوار (= کنار دیوار، جایی که سایه اش می افتد) راه برویم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001768525.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('e3e6df7f-a9e5-5b9b-8bbc-f84e8b10aada','737701a6-a868-560d-b1d0-ddc181b660d5',2,'darkness','تاریکی','spoken & written','darkness caused by something preventing light from reaching a place','[ uncountable ]',null,'تاریکی ناشی از چیزی که مانع رسیدن نور به مکانی می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['cast/throw a shadow (= make it appear ) The building cast a shadow across the narrow street.','a shadow falls somewhere (= appears on something ) The footsteps came closer, and a shadow fell across the table.','the shadows lengthen (= get longer, as it gets later in the day ) Already the shadows were lengthening.','a dark/black shadow She saw the dark shadow of a man in the doorway.','a long shadow Long shadows stretched across the grass from the apple trees.','flickering shadows (= shadows that move about quickly ) Candles cast strange flickering shadows on the walls.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The room was half in shadow.","translation":"اتاق نیمه سایه بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001768530.mp3"},{"sentence":"In the shadows, something moved.","translation":"در سایه، چیزی حرکت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001768533.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('3e2ccea9-101c-5a40-b412-7b8e56e20b45','737701a6-a868-560d-b1d0-ddc181b660d5',3,'bad effect/influence','اثر/نفوذ بد','spoken & written','the bad effect or influence that something has, which makes other things seem less enjoyable , attractive , or impressive','[ singular ]',null,'تأثیر یا تأثیر بدی که چیزی دارد، که باعث می شود چیزهای دیگر کمتر لذت بخش، جذاب یا تأثیرگذار به نظر برسند.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['cast/throw a shadow (= make it appear ) The building cast a shadow across the narrow street.','a shadow falls somewhere (= appears on something ) The footsteps came closer, and a shadow fell across the table.','the shadows lengthen (= get longer, as it gets later in the day ) Already the shadows were lengthening.','a dark/black shadow She saw the dark shadow of a man in the doorway.','a long shadow Long shadows stretched across the grass from the apple trees.','flickering shadows (= shadows that move about quickly ) Candles cast strange flickering shadows on the walls.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"For years, people had been living under the shadow of terrorism.","translation":"سال ها بود که مردم زیر سایه تروریسم زندگی می کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733254.mp3"},{"sentence":"The events of September 11th cast a shadow over the celebrations.","translation":"وقایع 11 سپتامبر بر این جشن ها سایه افکند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733258.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
