('161308e1-581f-5873-b8b9-46febdf3a5ac','3ddb9bd4-ba38-50a4-96c2-0082eaac0333',4,null,null,'spoken & written','the particular way in which someone speaks','[ uncountable ]',null,'روش خاصی که کسی با آن صحبت می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give/make a speech She gave a speech at the party conference.','deliver a speech formal The president delivered a major speech to Congress yesterday.','long The speeches were all really long.','short/brief The chairman opened the meeting with a brief speech.','a passionate/impassioned speech (= full of strong feeling ) She made impassioned speeches on civil rights.','an emotional speech (= showing emotions, especially by crying ) On retiring, she delivered an emotional farewell speech.','a moving speech (= making people feel strong emotions ) That was a very moving speech.','a powerful speech (= having a strong effect on people’s opinions ) He gave a powerful speech calling for unity.','a rousing/stirring speech (= making people feel excited and eager to do something ) Thousands of people were inspired by his stirring speeches.','a major speech (= very important ) This was her first major speech as party leader.','somebody’s inaugural speech (= their first one in an important political job ) He said all the right things in his inaugural speech.','somebody’s acceptance speech (= when they accept a political job, a prize, or an award ) In his acceptance speech, he paid tribute to his wife.','a farewell speech (= by someone who is leaving )','an after-dinner speech (= after a formal dinner ) He gets paid a lot for making after-dinner speeches.','a keynote speech (= the most important one at an event ) The prime minister will make his keynote speech at the conference today.','a political speech She began writing political speeches for local politicians.','a campaign speech (= given during a political campaign ) Eisenhower was careful in his campaign speeches to use only the vaguest of phrases.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Bob’s speech was slurred, and he sounded drunk.","translation":"سخنرانی باب نامفهوم بود و او به نظر مست بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000656178.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('a2f89797-3d49-5b56-944c-ba565e110b38','3ddb9bd4-ba38-50a4-96c2-0082eaac0333',5,null,null,'spoken & written','a set of lines that an actor must say in a play','[ countable ]',null,'مجموعه ای از خطوطی که یک بازیگر باید در نمایشنامه بگوید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give/make a speech She gave a speech at the party conference.','deliver a speech formal The president delivered a major speech to Congress yesterday.','long The speeches were all really long.','short/brief The chairman opened the meeting with a brief speech.','a passionate/impassioned speech (= full of strong feeling ) She made impassioned speeches on civil rights.','an emotional speech (= showing emotions, especially by crying ) On retiring, she delivered an emotional farewell speech.','a moving speech (= making people feel strong emotions ) That was a very moving speech.','a powerful speech (= having a strong effect on people’s opinions ) He gave a powerful speech calling for unity.','a rousing/stirring speech (= making people feel excited and eager to do something ) Thousands of people were inspired by his stirring speeches.','a major speech (= very important ) This was her first major speech as party leader.','somebody’s inaugural speech (= their first one in an important political job ) He said all the right things in his inaugural speech.','somebody’s acceptance speech (= when they accept a political job, a prize, or an award ) In his acceptance speech, he paid tribute to his wife.','a farewell speech (= by someone who is leaving )','an after-dinner speech (= after a formal dinner ) He gets paid a lot for making after-dinner speeches.','a keynote speech (= the most important one at an event ) The prime minister will make his keynote speech at the conference today.','a political speech She began writing political speeches for local politicians.','a campaign speech (= given during a political campaign ) Eisenhower was careful in his campaign speeches to use only the vaguest of phrases.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Hamlet’s longest speech","translation":"طولانی ترین سخنرانی هملت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000656183.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c84027ea-2c7c-552d-a2e4-2d1b90b2f758','339d7d18-2a49-5e91-9737-74275c2b1d9e',1,'character','شخصیت','spoken & written','the qualities that make someone live the way they do, and make them different from other people','[ singular, uncountable ]','kindred spirit','روح، روح (شخص)؛ روح (خدایی)؛ روح (جمع: مقامات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’m 85, but I still feel young in spirit.","translation":"من 85 ساله هستم، اما هنوز از نظر روحی جوان هستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001668645.mp3"},{"sentence":"She is a strong and independent spirit.","translation":"او یک روحیه قوی و مستقل است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001777588.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ac3dbbf0-0211-506e-bccd-bc42c7025f8a','339d7d18-2a49-5e91-9737-74275c2b1d9e',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'spirits','روح، روح (شخص)؛ روح (خدایی)؛ روح (جمع: مقامات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['high/good (= used when saying that someone is happy and excited ) The players were all in high spirits.','low/flagging (= used when saying that someone is sad ) She was tired and her spirits were low.','lift/raise/revive somebody’s spirits (= make them feel happier ) A brisk walk helped to lift my spirits.','keep somebody’s spirits up (= keep them feeling happy ) He wrote home often, trying to keep his family’s spirits up.','dampen somebody’s spirits (= make them feel less happy ) They refused to let the rain dampen their spirits.','somebody’s spirits rise/lift/soar (= they start feeling happier ) Her spirits rose as they left the ugliness of London behind.','somebody’s spirits sink (= they start feeling less happy ) His spirits sank at the prospect.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('c060692a-fe6a-5f16-9c3d-84c6f4f5fa17','339d7d18-2a49-5e91-9737-74275c2b1d9e',3,'soul','روح','spoken & written','the part of someone that you cannot see, that consists of the qualities that make up their character , which many people believe continues to live after the person has died','[ countable ]',null,'بخشی از کسی که نمی توانید آن را ببینید، که شامل ویژگی هایی است که شخصیت او را تشکیل می دهد، که بسیاری از مردم معتقدند پس از مرگ فرد به زندگی خود ادامه می دهد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Although Laurie is dead, I can feel his spirit with me.","translation":"اگرچه لوری مرده است، اما می توانم روح او را با خودم حس کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000659578.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c2e0394b-32a3-5028-a188-8e4bfc1c0460','339d7d18-2a49-5e91-9737-74275c2b1d9e',4,'no body','بدون بدن','spoken & written','a creature without a physical body that some people believe exists , such as an angel or a dead person, who has returned to this world and has strange or magical powers','[ countable ]',null,'موجودی بدون بدن فیزیکی که برخی معتقدند وجود دارد، مانند فرشته یا مرده ای که به این دنیا بازگشته و دارای قدرت های عجیب یا جادویی است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an evil spirit","translation":"یک روح شیطانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000659595.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('cf52ef9a-5f06-5e99-a4a3-eaecc47c9004','339d7d18-2a49-5e91-9737-74275c2b1d9e',5,'determination','عزم','spoken & written','courage , energy , and determination – used to show approval','[ uncountable ]',null,'شجاعت، انرژی و اراده - برای نشان دادن تایید استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Sandra is small, but she makes up for it with great spirit.","translation":"ساندرا کوچک است، اما با روحیه عالی جبران می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001668672.mp3"},{"sentence":"a young team with strong fighting spirit","translation":"تیمی جوان با روحیه جنگندگی قوی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001668673.mp3"},{"sentence":"When they took away his freedom, they broke his spirit (= made him lose his courage ) .","translation":"چون آزادی او را گرفتند، روحش را شکستند (= او را از جسارت باز کردند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001777594.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('47f0b4ab-a3b5-5916-99fd-623798b41ab5','339d7d18-2a49-5e91-9737-74275c2b1d9e',6,'attitude','نگرش','spoken & written','the attitude that you have towards something or while you are doing something','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'نگرشی که نسبت به چیزی دارید یا زمانی که مشغول انجام کاری هستید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You’ve got to approach this meeting in the right spirit.","translation":"شما باید با روحیه مناسب به این جلسه نزدیک شوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000659656.mp3"},{"sentence":"the spirit of cooperation between the two sides","translation":"روحیه همکاری بین دو طرف","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001777601.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('f7577ed2-b235-5155-89f0-280f933b035d','339d7d18-2a49-5e91-9737-74275c2b1d9e',7,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'team/community/public etc spirit','روح، روح (شخص)؛ روح (خدایی)؛ روح (جمع: مقامات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('037c19f1-1297-5d22-8b16-6c6d2eb96a4c','339d7d18-2a49-5e91-9737-74275c2b1d9e',8,'typical qualities','کیفیت های معمولی','spoken & written','the set of ideas, beliefs , feelings etc that are typical of a particular period in history , a place, or a group of people','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'مجموعه ای از ایده ها، باورها، احساسات و غیره که برای یک دوره خاص در تاریخ، یک مکان، یا گروهی از مردم مشخص است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Tourism has not destroyed the spirit of Bali.","translation":"گردشگری روح بالی را از بین نبرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001668690.mp3"},{"sentence":"His beliefs conflicted with the spirit of the age.","translation":"اعتقادات او با روح عصر در تضاد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001668693.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('991c9449-736f-509a-bd39-8760456e1fa2','339d7d18-2a49-5e91-9737-74275c2b1d9e',9,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'in spirit','روح، روح (شخص)؛ روح (خدایی)؛ روح (جمع: مقامات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
