('064a7c23-0fa8-58b5-8f72-33bccac78a72','339d7d18-2a49-5e91-9737-74275c2b1d9e',13,'drink','نوشیدنی','spoken & written','a strong alcoholic drink such as whisky or brandy','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'یک نوشیدنی الکلی قوی مانند ویسکی یا براندی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('a8fca4af-48ea-5480-85b0-284efb442184','339d7d18-2a49-5e91-9737-74275c2b1d9e',14,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'that’s the spirit','روح، روح (شخص)؛ روح (خدایی)؛ روح (جمع: مقامات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('7c0c7564-60db-589c-97f0-cbce967b279d','339d7d18-2a49-5e91-9737-74275c2b1d9e',15,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'when/as the spirit moves you','روح، روح (شخص)؛ روح (خدایی)؛ روح (جمع: مقامات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('22dfa2b4-5671-5aa6-b85f-bed0371b3811','339d7d18-2a49-5e91-9737-74275c2b1d9e',16,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the spirit is willing (but the flesh is weak)','روح، روح (شخص)؛ روح (خدایی)؛ روح (جمع: مقامات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('48b6595c-658c-558c-9930-b02b244cf41a','dfc53d8e-175b-51c6-93d1-dde7b513cbb5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to take someone or something away quickly and secretly',null,'spirit somebody/something away/off','به سرعت و مخفیانه کسی یا چیزی را دور کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"After his speech, Jackson was spirited away through a back door.","translation":"پس از سخنرانی، جکسون از در پشتی به بیرون رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000659699.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('83aebd13-8715-5d6e-8690-74f8aab53906','dee91a6a-9279-5ce2-894e-88ad8dc2c837',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a US spacecraft that landed on Mars in 2004. It moved around the surface of Mars to find signs of water, take sample s of soil , and take photographs .',null,null,'یک فضاپیمای آمریکایی که در سال 2004 بر روی مریخ فرود آمد. این فضاپیما در اطراف سطح مریخ حرکت کرد تا نشانه‌هایی از آب پیدا کند، از خاک نمونه برداری کند و عکس بگیرد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('5de80b0e-f1d5-5156-b611-69ac35e1c0d6','04a44da1-d401-501d-8a41-9d61998bf69f',1,'affect more people/places','افراد/مکان های بیشتری را تحت تاثیر قرار می دهد','spoken & written','if something spreads or is spread, it becomes larger or moves so that it affects more people or a larger area','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'گسترش یافتن؛ پخش کردن (خبر)؛ گسترش دادن (مساحت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a disease spreads/is spread (= among a group of people ) The disease is spread by mosquitoes.','a cancer/infection spreads (= in someone’s body ) The cancer had spread to his brain.','news/word spreads As news of his death spread, his army disintegrated.','spread the news/the word He has been spreading the word about ways to beat heart disease.','spread a story ( also spread a rumour British English , spread a rumor American English ) When Brown’s hotel burned down, Clark spread the rumor that Forsyth was to blame.','a story spreads ( also a rumour spreads British English , a rumor spreads American English ) It was the sort of story that would spread like wildfire.','spread lies/gossip How dare you spread such vicious lies! Has someone been spreading malicious gossip?','spread terror/panic The murders were clearly intended to spread terror.','fire spreads ( also flames spread ) The fire had spread to a nearby shed.','violence/fighting spreads There is no indication that the violence is likely to spread.','somebody’s fame/reputation spreads Their musical fame has spread far beyond their native country.','spread rapidly/quickly The fire spread rapidly, consuming many of the houses.','spread like wildfire (= spread extremely quickly ) The news spread like wildfire through the town.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Fire quickly spread through the building.","translation":"آتش به سرعت در داخل ساختمان پخش شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001586370.mp3"},{"sentence":"He watched the dark stain spread over the gray carpet.","translation":"لکه تیره ای که روی فرش خاکستری پخش شده بود را تماشا کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001586371.mp3"},{"sentence":"The disease spread rapidly amongst the poor.","translation":"این بیماری به سرعت در بین فقرا گسترش یافت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001586372.mp3"},{"sentence":"The cancer had spread to her liver.","translation":"سرطان به کبدش سرایت کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001586378.mp3"},{"sentence":"Revolution quickly spread from France to Italy.","translation":"انقلاب به سرعت از فرانسه به ایتالیا سرایت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001505.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('692f2583-effa-5590-bfe0-e482b594c7b5','04a44da1-d401-501d-8a41-9d61998bf69f',2,'information/ideas','اطلاعات/ایده ها','spoken & written','to become known about or used by more and more people','[ intransitive ]',null,'برای شناخته شدن یا استفاده توسط افراد بیشتر و بیشتر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a disease spreads/is spread (= among a group of people ) The disease is spread by mosquitoes.','a cancer/infection spreads (= in someone’s body ) The cancer had spread to his brain.','news/word spreads As news of his death spread, his army disintegrated.','spread the news/the word He has been spreading the word about ways to beat heart disease.','spread a story ( also spread a rumour British English , spread a rumor American English ) When Brown’s hotel burned down, Clark spread the rumor that Forsyth was to blame.','a story spreads ( also a rumour spreads British English , a rumor spreads American English ) It was the sort of story that would spread like wildfire.','spread lies/gossip How dare you spread such vicious lies! Has someone been spreading malicious gossip?','spread terror/panic The murders were clearly intended to spread terror.','fire spreads ( also flames spread ) The fire had spread to a nearby shed.','violence/fighting spreads There is no indication that the violence is likely to spread.','somebody’s fame/reputation spreads Their musical fame has spread far beyond their native country.','spread rapidly/quickly The fire spread rapidly, consuming many of the houses.','spread like wildfire (= spread extremely quickly ) The news spread like wildfire through the town.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"News of the explosion spread swiftly.","translation":"خبر انفجار به سرعت پخش شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000662957.mp3"},{"sentence":"Buddhism spread to China from India.","translation":"بودیسم از هند به چین گسترش یافت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000662960.mp3"},{"sentence":"The news spread like wildfire (= very quickly ) .","translation":"این خبر مانند آتش (= خیلی سریع) پخش شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001586380.mp3"},{"sentence":"Word spread quickly that she was leaving.","translation":"خبر به سرعت پخش شد که او می رود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040234.mp3"},{"sentence":"Andy loves spreading rumours about his colleagues.","translation":"اندی عاشق شایعه پراکنی در مورد همکارانش است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000662974.mp3"},{"sentence":"They are spreading the word about the benefits of immunization.","translation":"آنها در مورد مزایای ایمن سازی خبر می دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000662977.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('90403dd6-c505-5f34-bebe-88d31dde70d8','04a44da1-d401-501d-8a41-9d61998bf69f',3,'open/arrange','باز کردن / ترتیب دادن','spoken & written','to open something out or arrange a group of things so that they cover a flat surface','[ transitive ]',null,'برای باز کردن چیزی یا مرتب کردن گروهی از چیزها به گونه ای که سطح صافی را بپوشانند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Papers and photos were spread across the floor.","translation":"کاغذها و عکس ها روی زمین پخش شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000662937.mp3"},{"sentence":"He spread the map out on the desk.","translation":"نقشه را روی میز پهن کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000662934.mp3"},{"sentence":"a table spread with a white cloth","translation":"یک میز با یک پارچه سفید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001586392.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
