('7c0c6a3b-d613-58a5-aced-d2d617d0db1e','f2ab5eeb-7cc1-5b06-b24b-9cba264bd178',1,'worry','نگرانی','spoken & written','worry that is caused by having to deal with a problem or work too hard over a long period of time','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'فشار، فشار (روانی)؛ کشش (فلز)؛ فشار (ماده)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['great/considerable/severe strain The country’s health system is under great strain.','a terrible strain It’s been a terrible strain.','an intolerable strain (= too great to bear ) The cost of these wars put an intolerable strain on the economy.','undue strain (= too much strain ) How much can you invest without putting any undue strain on your finances?','emotional strain She has been suffering from considerable emotional strain.','financial strain This welfare program has eased the financial strain of raising children alone.','put/place (a) strain on somebody/something Living with my parents put quite a strain on our marriage.','crack/collapse/buckle etc under the strain (= become unable to continue normally because of the strain ) They are worried that the court system might collapse under the strain.','ease the strain (= make it less ) You can do much to ease the strain of the situation for her.','be under (a) strain Claudia could see that he was under considerable strain.','stresses and strains Holidays help people to cope with the stresses and strains of life.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I couldn’t look after him anymore; the strain was too much for me.","translation":"دیگر نمی‌توانستم از او مراقبت کنم. فشار برای من خیلی زیاد بود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00847.mp3"},{"sentence":"Did you find the job a strain ?","translation":"آیا کار را سخت می‌دانستید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001579977.mp3"},{"sentence":"the stresses and strains of police life","translation":"استرس ها و فشارهای زندگی پلیس","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000618910.mp3"},{"sentence":"The trial has been a terrible strain for both of us.","translation":"محاکمه برای هر دوی ما یک فشار وحشتناک بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001579988.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s quite a strain on me when he’s drinking heavily.","translation":"وقتی به شدت مشروب می‌نوشد، فشار زیادی بر من وارد می‌شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001579991.mp3"},{"sentence":"The long working hours put a severe strain on employees.","translation":"ساعات کاری طولانی فشار شدیدی بر کارمندان وارد می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000618903.mp3"},{"sentence":"I know you’ve been under a lot of strain lately.","translation":"می دانم که اخیراً تحت فشار زیادی بوده اید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000618906.mp3"},{"sentence":"I could see that she was beginning to crack under the strain.","translation":"می‌توانستم ببینم که او زیر فشار شروع به ترک خوردن کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001579997.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('0008e203-a558-55b3-90aa-84876ec31b24','f2ab5eeb-7cc1-5b06-b24b-9cba264bd178',2,'difficulty','دشواری','spoken & written','a difficulty or problem that is caused when a person, relationship , organization, or system has too much to do or too many problems to deal with','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'مشکل یا مشکلی که زمانی ایجاد می شود که یک شخص، رابطه، سازمان یا سیستم کارهای زیادی برای انجام دادن یا مشکلات زیادی برای مقابله با آن دارد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['great/considerable/severe strain The country’s health system is under great strain.','a terrible strain It’s been a terrible strain.','an intolerable strain (= too great to bear ) The cost of these wars put an intolerable strain on the economy.','undue strain (= too much strain ) How much can you invest without putting any undue strain on your finances?','emotional strain She has been suffering from considerable emotional strain.','financial strain This welfare program has eased the financial strain of raising children alone.','put/place (a) strain on somebody/something Living with my parents put quite a strain on our marriage.','crack/collapse/buckle etc under the strain (= become unable to continue normally because of the strain ) They are worried that the court system might collapse under the strain.','ease the strain (= make it less ) You can do much to ease the strain of the situation for her.','be under (a) strain Claudia could see that he was under considerable strain.','stresses and strains Holidays help people to cope with the stresses and strains of life.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The dry summer has further increased the strain on water resources.","translation":"تابستان خشک فشار بر منابع آب را بیشتر کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580000.mp3"},{"sentence":"The flu epidemic has put a huge strain on the health service.","translation":"اپیدمی آنفولانزا فشار زیادی بر خدمات بهداشتی وارد کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580003.mp3"},{"sentence":"The attack has led to strains in the relationship between the two countries.","translation":"این حمله منجر به تنش در روابط دو کشور شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000618951.mp3"},{"sentence":"His marriage was under strain.","translation":"ازدواج او تحت فشار بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580008.mp3"},{"sentence":"The party split under the strain.","translation":"حزب تحت فشار تقسیم شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580011.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('adfd1633-8612-543b-881b-381b9e1ba956','f2ab5eeb-7cc1-5b06-b24b-9cba264bd178',3,'force','زور','spoken & written','a situation in which something is being pulled or pushed , or is holding weight , and so might break or become damaged','[ uncountable ]',null,'وضعیتی که در آن چیزی در حال کشیده شدن یا هل دادن است یا وزن را نگه می دارد و بنابراین ممکن است بشکند یا آسیب ببیند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The strain on the cables supporting the bridge is enormous.","translation":"فشار روی کابل های پشتیبان پل بسیار زیاد است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000618926.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some of these exercises put too much strain on the back muscles.","translation":"برخی از این تمرینات فشار زیادی به عضلات پشت وارد می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580014.mp3"},{"sentence":"These four posts take the strain of the whole structure.","translation":"این چهار پست فشار کل ساختار را تحمل می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580015.mp3"},{"sentence":"The rope snapped under the strain.","translation":"طناب زیر فشار پاره شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000618930.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
