('2745b2d4-5424-59b2-bc13-d953d2e07706','1bd5204c-7a2a-59cf-93bc-5d138093d77b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to emphasize a statement , fact, or idea','[ transitive ]',null,'تأکید کردن، مهم‌شمار کردن (فرد)؛ برجسته کردن (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['stress the importance of something He has always stressed the importance of a stable family.','stress the need for something She stressed the need for more effective policing.','stress a point This point needs to be stressed.','stress a fact Medicines usually stress the fact that you must not exceed the stated dose.','stress the role of somebody/something In her speech, she stressed the role of parents in preventing youth crime.','stress your commitment to (doing) something The president stressed his commitment to tackling world poverty.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The report stressed that student math skills need to improve.","translation":"در این گزارش تاکید شده است که مهارت های ریاضی دانش آموزان باید بهبود یابد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669513.mp3"},{"sentence":"Crawford stressed the need for more housing downtown.","translation":"کرافورد بر نیاز به مسکن بیشتر در مرکز شهر تاکید کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669514.mp3"},{"sentence":"She stressed the importance of a balanced diet.","translation":"او بر اهمیت یک رژیم غذایی متعادل تاکید کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001983410.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('56c3781b-9cc8-5598-8a5e-02e3f85eea84','1bd5204c-7a2a-59cf-93bc-5d138093d77b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to pronounce a word or part of a word so that it sounds louder or more forceful','[ transitive ]',null,'برای تلفظ یک کلمه یا بخشی از یک کلمه به گونه ای که بلندتر یا قوی تر به نظر برسد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['stress the importance of something He has always stressed the importance of a stable family.','stress the need for something She stressed the need for more effective policing.','stress a point This point needs to be stressed.','stress a fact Medicines usually stress the fact that you must not exceed the stated dose.','stress the role of somebody/something In her speech, she stressed the role of parents in preventing youth crime.','stress your commitment to (doing) something The president stressed his commitment to tackling world poverty.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The word ‘machine’ is stressed on the second syllable.","translation":"کلمه \"ماشین\" روی هجای دوم تاکید شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000620701.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('0f2d6151-876a-5599-8090-1ec9091d3f7b','1bd5204c-7a2a-59cf-93bc-5d138093d77b',3,null,null,'informal','to feel very worried about something','[ intransitive ]',null,'در مورد چیزی احساس نگرانی شدید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['stress the importance of something He has always stressed the importance of a stable family.','stress the need for something She stressed the need for more effective policing.','stress a point This point needs to be stressed.','stress a fact Medicines usually stress the fact that you must not exceed the stated dose.','stress the role of somebody/something In her speech, she stressed the role of parents in preventing youth crime.','stress your commitment to (doing) something The president stressed his commitment to tackling world poverty.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She''s stressing about her exams.","translation":"او در مورد امتحاناتش استرس دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00849.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('2eaf4178-7506-5a7d-b513-feef15bef7a5','6275c636-91bc-5ce2-8e97-74384af05af8',1,null,null,'spoken & written','expecting people to obey rules or to do what you say',null,null,'سخت‌گیر، سختگیرانه (قانون)؛ سفت (خمیر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a strict teacher","translation":"یک معلم سخت گیر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621110.mp3"},{"sentence":"This company is very strict about punctuality.","translation":"این شرکت در مورد وقت شناسی بسیار سختگیر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621116.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Stuarts are very strict with their children.","translation":"استوارت ها نسبت به فرزندان خود بسیار سختگیر هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621113.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('6ebd7186-9f49-543d-8dfb-27fc727ca084','6275c636-91bc-5ce2-8e97-74384af05af8',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a strict order or rule is one that must be obeyed',null,null,'دستور یا قاعده اکید دستوری است که باید رعایت شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['strict rules/regulations/guidelines There are strict rules and regulations regarding conduct.','a strict code (= set of rules about what is acceptable ) The club has a strict dress code. Doctors have a strict code of conduct.','strict limits Many airlines impose strict limits on the weight of baggage.','strict orders/instructions He’s left strict instructions not to be disturbed.','strict control There must be strict control of local government spending.','strict discipline (= rules of behaviour which must be obeyed ) The head teacher insists upon strict discipline throughout the school.','strict requirements Landlords must comply with strict safety requirements.','strict criteria (= standards that are used for judging someone or making a decision about them ) The supermarket’s suppliers must meet strict criteria.','a strict diet He went on a strict diet and lost a lot of weight.','in strict confidence/in the strictest confidence (= kept completely secret ) Any information you give will be treated in the strictest confidence.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"You had strict instructions not to tell anybody.","translation":"تو دستورات سختی داشتی که به کسی نگی.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621120.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are strict limits on presidential campaign contributions.","translation":"محدودیت های سختی برای کمک های انتخاباتی ریاست جمهوری وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669648.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s under strict orders from his doctor to quit smoking.","translation":"او تحت دستور شدید پزشکش برای ترک سیگار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669652.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m telling you this in the strictest confidence (= it must be kept completely secret ) .","translation":"من این را با کمال اطمینان به شما می گویم (= باید کاملاً مخفی بماند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621124.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('8388d1f5-c15e-51dd-a347-c4c00e349362','6275c636-91bc-5ce2-8e97-74384af05af8',3,null,null,'spoken & written','exact and correct , often in a way that seems unreasonable','[ usually before noun ]',null,'دقیق و صحیح، اغلب به گونه ای که غیر منطقی به نظر می رسد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Amy was attractive, although not beautiful in the strictest sense of the word .","translation":"امی جذاب بود، اگرچه به معنای دقیق کلمه زیبا نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669659.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('baa5944d-f0f9-55ff-8453-0c76cdec61bb','6275c636-91bc-5ce2-8e97-74384af05af8',4,null,null,'spoken & written','obeying all the rules of a religion or set of principles',null,null,'اطاعت از تمام قواعد یک دین یا مجموعه ای از اصول','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He was raised a strict Catholic.","translation":"او به عنوان یک کاتولیک سخت تربیت شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001839919.mp3"},{"sentence":"a strict vegetarian","translation":"یک گیاهخوار سخت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001839920.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('7f1366fe-11b6-5fa8-b4a9-e37118e582f6','26106be2-40fd-5b93-8b61-75fb64238f21',1,'hit','ضربه بزنید','written','to hit or fall against the surface of something','[ transitive ]',null,'زدن، کوبیدن (ضربه)؛ برخورد کردن (با)؛ اتفاق افتادن (فکر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She fell heavily, striking her head against the side of the boat.","translation":"او به شدت زمین خورد و سرش را به کناره قایق زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797422.mp3"},{"sentence":"A snowball struck him on the back of the head.","translation":"گلوله برفی به پشت سر او اصابت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621372.mp3"},{"sentence":"Several cars were struck by falling trees.","translation":"چند خودرو با سقوط درختان برخورد کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621378.mp3"},{"sentence":"The last rays of the setting sun struck the windows.","translation":"آخرین پرتوهای غروب خورشید به پنجره ها برخورد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040254.mp3"},{"sentence":"I hit my head on the shelf.","translation":"سرم را به قفسه زدم.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"He was hit by a rock.","translation":"او با سنگ برخورد کرد.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,6),
('8d0b6c89-6169-52f8-ac4f-f150a806aba4','26106be2-40fd-5b93-8b61-75fb64238f21',2,'hit with hand/weapon etc','ضربه با دست / سلاح و غیره','formal','to deliberately hit someone or something with your hand or a weapon','[ transitive ]',null,'ضربه زدن عمدی به کسی یا چیزی با دست یا سلاح','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She struck him hard across the face.","translation":"ضربه محکمی به صورت او زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797424.mp3"},{"sentence":"The victim had been struck with some kind of wooden implement.","translation":"مقتول با نوعی وسیله چوبی مورد اصابت قرار گرفته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621389.mp3"},{"sentence":"Paul struck him a blow to the head.","translation":"پل ضربه ای به سر او زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621392.mp3"},{"sentence":"The assassin’s bullet struck home (= hit exactly where it should ) .","translation":"گلوله قاتل به خانه اصابت کرد (= دقیقا همان جایی که باید اصابت کرد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621396.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('75dfc308-c42e-5664-8a88-aec59afda7f3','26106be2-40fd-5b93-8b61-75fb64238f21',3,'thought/idea','فکر/ایده','spoken & written','if something strikes you, you think of it, notice it, or realize that it is important, interesting, true etc','[ transitive ]',null,'اگر چیزی به شما توجه کند، به آن فکر می کنید، متوجه آن می شوید یا متوجه می شوید که مهم، جالب، واقعی است و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A rather worrying thought struck me.","translation":"فکر نسبتا نگران کننده ای به ذهنم خطور کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621320.mp3"},{"sentence":"The first thing that struck me was the fact that there were no other women present.","translation":"اولین چیزی که مرا تحت تأثیر قرار داد این بود که هیچ زن دیگری در آنجا حضور نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797436.mp3"},{"sentence":"It struck her that losing the company might be the least of her worries.","translation":"به او متوجه شد که از دست دادن شرکت ممکن است کمترین نگرانی او باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621323.mp3"},{"sentence":"You can’t help being struck by her kindness.","translation":"نمی توانید از محبت او غافل نشوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621326.mp3"},{"sentence":"It strikes me that they are similar.","translation":"برام جالبه که شبیه همن","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,5),
('0a1f64b2-45f1-5d49-a46f-2017b9c35d48','26106be2-40fd-5b93-8b61-75fb64238f21',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'strike somebody as (being) something','زدن، کوبیدن (ضربه)؛ برخورد کردن (با)؛ اتفاق افتادن (فکر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('c380560c-e0a8-5b89-b772-eaf01c6da0c4','26106be2-40fd-5b93-8b61-75fb64238f21',5,'stop work','کار را متوقف کنید','spoken & written','if a group of workers strike, they stop working as a protest against something relating to their work, for example how much they are paid, bad working conditions etc','[ intransitive ]',null,'اگر گروهی از کارگران اعتصاب کنند، به عنوان اعتراض به چیزی که به کارشان مربوط می شود، مثلاً چقدر حقوق می گیرند، شرایط بد کار و غیره، دست از کار می کشند.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"In many countries, the police are forbidden to strike.","translation":"در بسیاری از کشورها، پلیس اعتصاب ممنوع است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621356.mp3"},{"sentence":"They’re striking for the right to have their trade union recognized in law.","translation":"آنها برای حق به رسمیت شناخته شدن اتحادیه کارگری خود در قانون اعتصاب می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621359.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0cc57f46-f178-5132-89bd-3e7465f29ce1','26106be2-40fd-5b93-8b61-75fb64238f21',6,'attack','حمله کنند','spoken & written','to attack someone, especially suddenly','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'حمله کردن به کسی مخصوصاً ناگهانی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The killer might strike again.","translation":"ممکن است قاتل دوباره ضربه بزند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621417.mp3"},{"sentence":"Guerrillas struck a UN camp, killing 75.","translation":"چریک ها به یک اردوگاه سازمان ملل حمله کردند و 75 نفر را کشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797445.mp3"},{"sentence":"Opponents of the war say that civilian villages have been struck several times.","translation":"مخالفان جنگ می گویند که چندین بار به روستاهای غیرنظامی حمله شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797446.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('4adc54d3-b0ed-54b1-98fa-c4c160fe178f','26106be2-40fd-5b93-8b61-75fb64238f21',7,'harm','آسیب','spoken & written','to damage or harm someone or something','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'آسیب رساندن یا آسیب رساندن به کسی یا چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The law would strike at the most basic of civil rights.","translation":"این قانون به اساسی ترین حقوق شهروندی ضربه می زند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797455.mp3"},{"sentence":"Such prejudices strike right at the heart of any notions of a civilized society.","translation":"چنین پیش داوری هایی درست به قلب هر تصوری از یک جامعه متمدن ضربه می زند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797456.mp3"},{"sentence":"The scandal seemed to have struck a mortal blow to the government’s chances of re-election.","translation":"به نظر می رسید که این رسوایی ضربه مهلکی به شانس دولت برای انتخاب مجدد وارد کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797464.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('7744fad8-4112-5341-9950-ce85a8e94c3e','26106be2-40fd-5b93-8b61-75fb64238f21',8,'something bad happens','اتفاق بدی می افتد','spoken & written','if something bad strikes, it suddenly happens or suddenly begins to affect someone','[ intransitive, transitive ]','stricken','اگر اتفاق بدی رخ دهد، به طور ناگهانی اتفاق می افتد یا ناگهان شروع به تأثیرگذاری بر کسی می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The plague struck again for the third time that century.","translation":"طاعون برای سومین بار در آن قرن شیوع یافت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000621428.mp3"},{"sentence":"Everything seemed to be going fine when suddenly disaster struck .","translation":"به نظر می رسید که همه چیز خوب پیش می رود که ناگهان فاجعه رخ داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797466.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
