('2669e8b4-19ea-5048-8d96-9f3fdfec8067','f89c69d3-940d-5cc6-b007-20c18b679414',1,'illness','بیماری','spoken & written','if someone has a stroke, an artery (= tube carrying blood ) in their brain suddenly bursts or becomes blocked , so that they may die or be unable to use some muscles',null,null,'سکته، سکته مغزی؛ ضربه (قلم)؛ ضرب (موسیقی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have/suffer a stroke My father had a stroke.','a stroke leaves somebody paralysed (= someone can no longer move as the result of a stroke ) Two years later she had a stroke which left her paralysed.','a massive/major stroke (= one that has very bad effects ) Her brother has just died of a massive stroke.','a minor/mild stroke (= one that does not have very bad effects ) She had a minor stroke five years ago.','a fatal stroke (= one that kills someone ) He suffered a fatal stroke in April.','a stroke patient/victim Some stroke victims recover fully.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She died following a massive stroke.","translation":"او به دنبال یک سکته مغزی شدید فوت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000622596.mp3"},{"sentence":"I looked after my father after he had a stroke.","translation":"بعد از اینکه پدرم سکته کرد مراقبش بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000622599.mp3"},{"sentence":"a stroke patient","translation":"یک بیمار سکته مغزی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001983439.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
