('bc7c213f-02f1-509e-8488-ba33beaf42ac','02190e54-4ad0-5d9b-bcde-cbf6a8e9a36b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the time of the year when the sun is hottest and the days are longest, between spring and autumn',null,null,'تابستان، تابستان (فصل)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['hot It had been a long hot summer.','dry/wet We’ve had a very dry summer.','high summer (= the middle of summer ) In high summer, food was plentiful.','early/late summer In the late summer of 1931, Joe returned to Oxford.','last/next summer He visited Brittany last summer.','a summer holiday British English , a summer vacation American English Where are you going for your summer holiday?','a summer’s day/evening ( also a summer day/evening ) It was a beautiful summer’s day.','the summer months The garden is open daily in the summer months.','the summer season The resort was crammed with holidaymakers for the whole of the summer season.','the summer heat Crowds of shoppers are sweltering in the summer heat.','the summer sun They lay on the beach, soaking up the summer sun.','in/at the height of summer (= in the middle of summer ) Even in the height of summer, it’s cool in here.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the long hot summer of 1976","translation":"تابستان گرم طولانی سال 1976","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607808.mp3"},{"sentence":"The children play on the beach during the summer.","translation":"بچه ها در تابستان در ساحل بازی می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607809.mp3"},{"sentence":"Miriam likes to relax in her garden in summer.","translation":"میریام دوست دارد در تابستان در باغ خود استراحت کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607812.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’re going to Italy next summer.","translation":"تابستان آینده به ایتالیا می رویم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000632756.mp3"},{"sentence":"a hot summer’s day","translation":"یک روز گرم تابستانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000632753.mp3"},{"sentence":"a sunny summer afternoon","translation":"یک بعد از ظهر آفتابی تابستانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000632752.mp3"},{"sentence":"a three-week summer vacation","translation":"یک تعطیلات تابستانی سه هفته ای","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607813.mp3"},{"sentence":"The tourist season lasts through late summer.","translation":"فصل گردشگری تا اواخر تابستان ادامه دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000632760.mp3"},{"sentence":"Parts of Spain are extremely hot in high summer (= the hottest part of summer ) .","translation":"بخش‌هایی از اسپانیا در فصل تابستان (= گرمترین بخش تابستان) بسیار گرم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607814.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
