('5be3189c-54d2-5588-8bc0-fc669f146913','3cbca3ce-5f77-56a5-b5ac-83c9018a56ef',1,'amount available','مقدار موجود','spoken & written','an amount of something that is available to be used','[ countable ]','money supply','عرضه، عرضه (کالا)؛ ارائه (برق)؛ عرضه (بازار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a good supply In hot countries, always carry a good supply of water.','a plentiful/abundant supply formal: There was a plentiful supply of books and magazines to read.','an adequate supply The larger cities usually have more modern health facilities and an adequate supply of medicines.','a constant/steady/regular supply For dairy farming, a constant supply of lush grass is essential.','an endless/inexhaustible supply (= one that does not end, or seems not to end ) He has an endless supply of jokes.','a ready supply (= one that is easily available ) The early settlers also found a ready supply of flints in the chalk cliffs.','a small/limited supply There is a limited supply of land for building.','a dwindling supply (= one that is getting smaller ) We cannot rely on the dwindling supplies of crude oil and natural gas.','a fresh supply A fresh supply of fuel was needed.','use up/exhaust a supply The diver had nearly used up his supply of oxygen.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve only got a week’s supply of tablets left.","translation":"فقط یک هفته از تبلت باقی مانده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612255.mp3"},{"sentence":"There was a plentiful supply of cheap labour.","translation":"نیروی کار ارزان فراوانی وجود داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612258.mp3"},{"sentence":"The nation’s fuel supplies will not last forever.","translation":"ذخایر سوخت کشور برای همیشه دوام نخواهد داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612259.mp3"},{"sentence":"To protect the food supply , the government ordered the slaughter of affected cattle.","translation":"برای محافظت از عرضه مواد غذایی، دولت دستور کشتار گاوهای آسیب دیده را صادر کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612260.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
