('cc4f2aac-e5f9-541e-befe-604017476feb','5b283f27-45ec-5320-ad7f-b3e894e25c36',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to provide people with something that they need or want, especially regularly over a long period of time',null,null,'عرضه کردن، رساندن (کالا)؛ فراهم کردن (نیاز)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Paint for the project was supplied by the city.","translation":"رنگ پروژه توسط شهر تامین شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612281.mp3"},{"sentence":"An informer supplied the police with the names of those involved in the crime.","translation":"یک مطلع اسامی دست اندرکاران این جنایت را در اختیار پلیس قرار داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001612284.mp3"},{"sentence":"They were arrested for supplying drugs to street dealers.","translation":"آنها به دلیل عرضه مواد مخدر به دلالان خیابانی دستگیر شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000600684.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('2900b490-ce7e-5cdd-8ece-e332a02b35d2','5b283f27-45ec-5320-ad7f-b3e894e25c36',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be well/poorly/generously supplied with something','عرضه کردن، رساندن (کالا)؛ فراهم کردن (نیاز)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('0dd79f95-f287-5fff-b262-ba5be6df59fe','ea892ed2-b40b-53db-91ce-9671c94d2f6b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to show that you think something must be true, especially when people seem to be disagreeing with you','[ sentence adverb ]',null,'حتماً، بدون شک (تأکید)؛ یقیناً','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You must have heard about the riots, surely?","translation":"حتما در مورد شورش ها شنیده اید، حتما؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000601572.mp3"},{"sentence":"There must surely be some explanation.","translation":"حتما باید یه توضیحی باشه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000601573.mp3"},{"sentence":"Surely we can’t just stand back and let this happen?","translation":"مطمئناً ما نمی‌توانیم عقب بایستیم و اجازه دهیم این اتفاق بیفتد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000601574.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('7b2e9d62-cbb0-5e27-8aab-376249434692','ea892ed2-b40b-53db-91ce-9671c94d2f6b',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'surely not','حتماً، بدون شک (تأکید)؛ یقیناً','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('92042a3a-7b50-578c-8d50-0d89c59de6f3','ea892ed2-b40b-53db-91ce-9671c94d2f6b',3,null,null,'formal','certainly',null,null,'قطعا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Such sinners will surely be punished.","translation":"چنین گناهکارانی حتما مجازات خواهند شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000601585.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('b904ca3f-0377-5bf6-bdef-54b835e4a529','ea892ed2-b40b-53db-91ce-9671c94d2f6b',4,null,null,'old-fashioned','used to say ‘ yes ’ to someone or to express agreement with them',null,null,'به کسی «بله» می‌گفت یا با او موافقت می‌کرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('2de02647-717f-585e-b2e1-3b1822b20f22','cdf08bee-874c-51f3-b685-e1a966a123ad',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a set of questions that you ask a large number of people in order to find out about their opinions or behaviour',null,null,'نظرسنجی، سنجش (افکار)؛ بررسی (میدانی)؛ مساحی (زمین)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['carry out/do a survey The survey was carried out by Warwick University.','conduct a survey formal (= do a survey ) a survey conducted by the British Medical Association.','a survey shows/reveals something Our survey showed that many women are afraid to go out alone at night.','a survey finds something A survey found that 37 percent of students were born outside the country.','a survey suggests something Recent surveys suggest that these are the foreign languages most in demand by employers.','a recent/new survey According to a recent survey, students buy an average of 11.33 books a year for their courses.','an annual survey Every council will be required to conduct an annual survey of residents.','a national survey A national survey revealed that one in four 15-year-olds smokes regularly.','an extensive survey We conducted an extensive survey asking patients to suggest ways in which the service could be improved.','a detailed survey The author carried out a detailed survey of 32 organizations in Japan and Korea.','an opinion survey Opinion surveys showed consistently that unemployment remained a matter of concern.','a customer survey They have begun to listen carefully to their customers, through customer surveys, focus groups, etc.','the results of a survey The results of the survey have not yet been analysed.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We conducted a survey of parents in the village.","translation":"ما یک نظرسنجی از والدین در روستا انجام دادیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602693.mp3"},{"sentence":"a survey of US businesses","translation":"نظرسنجی از مشاغل ایالات متحده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040260.mp3"},{"sentence":"The survey showed that Britain’s trees are in good health.","translation":"این نظرسنجی نشان داد که درختان بریتانیا از سلامت خوبی برخوردار هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001616452.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('caf47341-3a08-51d4-a7f5-79e8ee1278e4','cdf08bee-874c-51f3-b685-e1a966a123ad',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an examination of an area of land in order to make a map of it',null,null,'بررسی یک مساحت زمین به منظور تهیه نقشه آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['carry out/do a survey The survey was carried out by Warwick University.','conduct a survey formal (= do a survey ) a survey conducted by the British Medical Association.','a survey shows/reveals something Our survey showed that many women are afraid to go out alone at night.','a survey finds something A survey found that 37 percent of students were born outside the country.','a survey suggests something Recent surveys suggest that these are the foreign languages most in demand by employers.','a recent/new survey According to a recent survey, students buy an average of 11.33 books a year for their courses.','an annual survey Every council will be required to conduct an annual survey of residents.','a national survey A national survey revealed that one in four 15-year-olds smokes regularly.','an extensive survey We conducted an extensive survey asking patients to suggest ways in which the service could be improved.','a detailed survey The author carried out a detailed survey of 32 organizations in Japan and Korea.','an opinion survey Opinion surveys showed consistently that unemployment remained a matter of concern.','a customer survey They have begun to listen carefully to their customers, through customer surveys, focus groups, etc.','the results of a survey The results of the survey have not yet been analysed.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
