('8d1e146a-702d-57db-bfeb-95d83fd8d9b9','cdf08bee-874c-51f3-b685-e1a966a123ad',4,null,null,'spoken & written','a general description or report about a particular subject or situation',null,null,'توصیف یا گزارش کلی در مورد یک موضوع یا موقعیت خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['carry out/do a survey The survey was carried out by Warwick University.','conduct a survey formal (= do a survey ) a survey conducted by the British Medical Association.','a survey shows/reveals something Our survey showed that many women are afraid to go out alone at night.','a survey finds something A survey found that 37 percent of students were born outside the country.','a survey suggests something Recent surveys suggest that these are the foreign languages most in demand by employers.','a recent/new survey According to a recent survey, students buy an average of 11.33 books a year for their courses.','an annual survey Every council will be required to conduct an annual survey of residents.','a national survey A national survey revealed that one in four 15-year-olds smokes regularly.','an extensive survey We conducted an extensive survey asking patients to suggest ways in which the service could be improved.','a detailed survey The author carried out a detailed survey of 32 organizations in Japan and Korea.','an opinion survey Opinion surveys showed consistently that unemployment remained a matter of concern.','a customer survey They have begun to listen carefully to their customers, through customer surveys, focus groups, etc.','the results of a survey The results of the survey have not yet been analysed.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a survey of modern English literature","translation":"بررسی ادبیات مدرن انگلیسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602704.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('6f9754dd-9a6f-5eb4-9fc1-aa00ffe1e7ee','442c238f-e5c1-56d4-95f1-6d658efc0915',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to ask a large number of people questions in order to find out their attitudes or opinions',null,null,'سوال پرسیدن از تعداد زیادی از مردم به منظور یافتن نگرش یا نظرات آنها','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Of the 100 companies surveyed, 10% had a turnover of £50m to £99m.","translation":"از 100 شرکت مورد بررسی، 10 درصد گردش مالی بین 50 تا 99 میلیون پوند داشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040261.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('0bbf686d-1df7-5b9a-8217-c2a3bf0a9148','442c238f-e5c1-56d4-95f1-6d658efc0915',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to look at or consider someone or something carefully, especially in order to form an opinion about them',null,null,'با دقت به کسی یا چیزی نگاه کردن یا در نظر گرفتن، به ویژه برای ایجاد نظر در مورد آنها','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She turned to survey her daughter’s pale face.","translation":"برگشت تا چهره رنگ پریده دخترش را بررسی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602721.mp3"},{"sentence":"They got out of the car to survey the damage.","translation":"آنها برای بررسی خسارت از ماشین پیاده شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001616458.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('d739db93-a248-5804-a7c6-adb87232c079','442c238f-e5c1-56d4-95f1-6d658efc0915',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to examine the condition of a house or other building and make a report on it, especially for people who want to buy it',null,null,'بررسی وضعیت خانه یا ساختمان دیگر و تهیه گزارش از آن به ویژه برای افرادی که قصد خرید آن را دارند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('514b9aff-19e5-52c5-9108-45de99d6b77c','442c238f-e5c1-56d4-95f1-6d658efc0915',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to examine and measure an area of land and record the details on a map',null,null,'برای بررسی و اندازه گیری مساحت زمین و ثبت جزئیات روی نقشه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"There were many voyages to survey the ocean depths in the nineteenth century.","translation":"در قرن نوزدهم سفرهای زیادی برای بررسی اعماق اقیانوس ها وجود داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602729.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('36a55817-7b6f-50ed-9349-261dae0ec6e2','985302a7-e0b6-56ec-90ce-3b4f12560fdf',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to change from doing or using one thing to doing or using another','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'تعویض کردن، عوض کردن (وضع)؛ تغییر دادن (تلویزیون)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['switch sides (= start supporting someone or something else ) Three senators switched sides and voted for the ban.','switch (your) allegiance (= start supporting someone else ) Most of his supporters had switched their allegiance to his rival.','switch channels (= start watching a different TV channel ) Rod switched channels with the remote control.','switch tactics Sensing that his victim was going to escape him, he switched tactics.','switch your attention/focus to something Laura wasn''t interested so he switched his attention to Tessa.','switch brands 46% of consumers surveyed were likely to switch brands to support companies they saw as socially responsible,','the emphasis switches/is switched to something The emphasis has switched to defence.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She worked as a librarian before switching to journalism.","translation":"او قبل از روی آوردن به روزنامه نگاری به عنوان کتابدار کار می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580153.mp3"},{"sentence":"Duval could switch easily from French to English.","translation":"دووال می توانست به راحتی از فرانسوی به انگلیسی تغییر کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580156.mp3"},{"sentence":"He switches between TV and theatre work.","translation":"او بین کار تلویزیون و تئاتر سوئیچ می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580159.mp3"},{"sentence":"The terrorists will switch tactics .","translation":"تروریست ها تاکتیک ها را تغییر خواهند داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580160.mp3"},{"sentence":"He switched sides just days before the election.","translation":"او چند روز قبل از انتخابات تغییر سمت داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000606637.mp3"},{"sentence":"We want to switch focus away from criticism.","translation":"ما می خواهیم تمرکز را از انتقاد دور کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020281.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('d02a1070-bc2f-5c49-8dc3-574830df9db6','985302a7-e0b6-56ec-90ce-3b4f12560fdf',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to replace one thing with another, or exchange things','[ transitive ]',null,'برای جایگزینی یک چیز با چیز دیگر، یا مبادله چیزها',array['change']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['switch sides (= start supporting someone or something else ) Three senators switched sides and voted for the ban.','switch (your) allegiance (= start supporting someone else ) Most of his supporters had switched their allegiance to his rival.','switch channels (= start watching a different TV channel ) Rod switched channels with the remote control.','switch tactics Sensing that his victim was going to escape him, he switched tactics.','switch your attention/focus to something Laura wasn''t interested so he switched his attention to Tessa.','switch brands 46% of consumers surveyed were likely to switch brands to support companies they saw as socially responsible,','the emphasis switches/is switched to something The emphasis has switched to defence.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Tim may switch his BMW for something else.","translation":"تیم ممکن است BMW خود را با چیز دیگری تغییر دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580170.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’ve switched the meeting from Tuesday to Thursday.","translation":"ما جلسه را از سه شنبه به پنجشنبه تغییر دادیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580173.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s not easy to switch clerical workers around.","translation":"جابجایی کارکنان دفتری کار آسانی نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580176.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('e1eb75ea-f22f-5a31-888f-567af9b8b795','985302a7-e0b6-56ec-90ce-3b4f12560fdf',3,null,null,'spoken & written','if you switch with someone who does the same job as you, you exchange your working times with theirs for a short time','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'اگر با شخصی عوض شوید که کار مشابه شما را انجام می دهد، زمان کاری خود را برای مدت کوتاهی با او عوض می کنید',array['swap']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['switch sides (= start supporting someone or something else ) Three senators switched sides and voted for the ban.','switch (your) allegiance (= start supporting someone else ) Most of his supporters had switched their allegiance to his rival.','switch channels (= start watching a different TV channel ) Rod switched channels with the remote control.','switch tactics Sensing that his victim was going to escape him, he switched tactics.','switch your attention/focus to something Laura wasn''t interested so he switched his attention to Tessa.','switch brands 46% of consumers surveyed were likely to switch brands to support companies they saw as socially responsible,','the emphasis switches/is switched to something The emphasis has switched to defence.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Tom said he’d switch with me on Saturday.","translation":"تام گفت که شنبه با من عوض می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580184.mp3"},{"sentence":"He asked if we could switch shifts.","translation":"او پرسید که آیا می‌توانیم شیفت‌ها را عوض کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001780077.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('e512612a-a609-51d5-a7f5-9c5754533a16','985302a7-e0b6-56ec-90ce-3b4f12560fdf',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to change the way a machine operates , using a switch','[ transitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'برای تغییر نحوه عملکرد ماشین، با استفاده از یک سوئیچ','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['switch sides (= start supporting someone or something else ) Three senators switched sides and voted for the ban.','switch (your) allegiance (= start supporting someone else ) Most of his supporters had switched their allegiance to his rival.','switch channels (= start watching a different TV channel ) Rod switched channels with the remote control.','switch tactics Sensing that his victim was going to escape him, he switched tactics.','switch your attention/focus to something Laura wasn''t interested so he switched his attention to Tessa.','switch brands 46% of consumers surveyed were likely to switch brands to support companies they saw as socially responsible,','the emphasis switches/is switched to something The emphasis has switched to defence.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Switch the freezer to ‘defrost’.","translation":"فریزر را روی «یخ زدایی» تغییر دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580190.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('65e1b410-eb73-55c8-9eae-a861625c6ea0','65e1374e-3492-5aee-bd41-876bf453d2c8',1,'on/off','روشن/خاموش','spoken & written','a piece of equipment that starts or stops the flow of electricity to a machine, light etc when you push it',null,null,'کلید برق، سوییچ؛ تعویض (حالت)؛ کلید (سینی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['press a switch He pressed a switch on the wall and the door opened.','flick/flip a switch (= move it so something starts or stops ) You start the fan by just flipping this switch.','throw a switch (= move it so something starts or stops, especially something big ) Could a nuclear war really be started by someone just throwing a switch?','a light switch He reached for the light switch.','a dimmer switch (= a switch that can change the brightness of a light )','an on-off switch I couldn’t find the on-off switch.','the power switch They have reverted to placing the mains power switch at the back of the unit.','the mains switch (= one that controls the supply of electricity to a house ) The mains switch is located inside a cupboard near the front door.','at the flick/touch of a switch (= very quickly and easily, with a switch ) The advantages of having electricity available at the flick of a switch are obvious.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Where’s the light switch ?","translation":"کلید چراغ کجاست؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000606732.mp3"},{"sentence":"an on–off switch","translation":"یک کلید روشن و خاموش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580224.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tom flicked the switch, but nothing happened.","translation":"تام سوئیچ را زد، اما هیچ اتفاقی نیفتاد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580229.mp3"},{"sentence":"She claims she is willing to throw the switch of the electric chair.","translation":"او ادعا می کند که حاضر است کلید صندلی برقی را پرتاب کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000606737.mp3"},{"sentence":"Petrol can be chosen at the flick of a switch.","translation":"بنزین را می توان با تکان دادن سوئیچ انتخاب کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580233.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('7ffffe1b-9d7d-5681-bf1c-9ef65abafa88','65e1374e-3492-5aee-bd41-876bf453d2c8',2,'change','تغییر دهید','spoken informal','a complete change from one thing to another','[ usually singular ]',null,'تغییر کامل از یک چیز به چیز دیگر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['press a switch He pressed a switch on the wall and the door opened.','flick/flip a switch (= move it so something starts or stops ) You start the fan by just flipping this switch.','throw a switch (= move it so something starts or stops, especially something big ) Could a nuclear war really be started by someone just throwing a switch?','a light switch He reached for the light switch.','a dimmer switch (= a switch that can change the brightness of a light )','an on-off switch I couldn’t find the on-off switch.','the power switch They have reverted to placing the mains power switch at the back of the unit.','the mains switch (= one that controls the supply of electricity to a house ) The mains switch is located inside a cupboard near the front door.','at the flick/touch of a switch (= very quickly and easily, with a switch ) The advantages of having electricity available at the flick of a switch are obvious.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"an important policy switch","translation":"یک تغییر سیاست مهم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580239.mp3"},{"sentence":"the switch from agriculture to dairy production","translation":"تغییر از کشاورزی به تولید لبنیات","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580238.mp3"},{"sentence":"a switch in emphasis","translation":"یک سوئیچ در تاکید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001580242.mp3"},{"sentence":"More shoppers are making the switch to organic food.","translation":"خریداران بیشتری به سمت غذاهای ارگانیک روی می آورند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000606741.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Ed’s the only one who’s not eating.’ ‘That’s a switch!’","translation":"«اد تنها کسی است که غذا نمی‌خورد.» «این یک سوئیچ است!»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000606746.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
