('bd8f3930-9769-5c79-a2c9-e773704ab0fc','164285ad-44ba-5612-b771-a831fd611d99',1,null,null,'spoken & written','in the past , a type of system used for paying for goods and services in the UK, by which customers used a type of plastic card called a debit card , and money was immediately taken out of their bank account . Since 2002, Switch has been replaced by Maestro , the Mastercard brand of debit card.',null,null,'در گذشته نوعی سیستم برای پرداخت کالا و خدمات در انگلستان مورد استفاده قرار می گرفت که توسط آن مشتریان از نوعی کارت پلاستیکی به نام کارت نقدی استفاده می کردند و بلافاصله پول از حساب بانکی آنها خارج می شد. از سال 2002، سوئیچ با Maestro، نام تجاری کارت بدهی Mastercard جایگزین شده است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('ebea421f-abf8-5ebe-9e96-91ddd2760a42','a32ad9a0-54e3-5dad-b7cf-14a3928ca396',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a picture or shape that has a particular meaning or represents a particular organization or idea',null,null,'نماد، علامت؛ نشانه (فرهنگ)؛ نماد (ریاضی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The symbol on the packet is a guarantee that the food has been produced organically.","translation":"نماد روی بسته تضمینی است که غذا به صورت ارگانیک تولید شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577748.mp3"},{"sentence":"The dove is a symbol of peace.","translation":"کبوتر نماد صلح است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000607414.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('6a1b583e-f214-52c8-b4fe-f731b12827e5','a32ad9a0-54e3-5dad-b7cf-14a3928ca396',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a letter , number, or sign that represents a sound, an amount , a chemical substance etc',null,null,'یک حرف، عدد یا علامتی که بیانگر یک صدا، مقدار، یک ماده شیمیایی و غیره است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Fe is the chemical symbol for iron.","translation":"Fe نماد شیمیایی آهن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000607418.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('fba883af-0f91-5bbe-abf3-4c224dc57878','a32ad9a0-54e3-5dad-b7cf-14a3928ca396',3,null,null,'spoken & written','someone or something that represents a particular quality or idea',null,null,'کسی یا چیزی که نمایانگر یک کیفیت یا ایده خاص است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Space exploration provides a symbol of national pride.","translation":"اکتشاف فضایی نمادی از غرور ملی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000607427.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c8d3f648-8733-50c7-b177-4bf09b1ac50f','f706cf6f-a111-5317-a257-e53c9074107e',1,'related parts','قطعات مرتبط','spoken & written','a group of related parts that work together as a whole for a particular purpose','[ countable ]',null,'سامانه، سیستم؛ سیستم (دفاعی)؛ دستگاه (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a heating system (= in a building ) We’re waiting for the heating system to be repaired.','an alarm/security system A new alarm system has been installed.','an air-conditioning system The building hasn’t got an air-conditioning system.','the rail/road system (= all the roads or railways in a country ) Traffic problems are made worse by the country’s inadequate road system.','somebody’s digestive/reproductive/nervous system (= in someone’s body ) These vitamins are essential for a healthy nervous system.','somebody’s immune system (= they system which keeps your body healthy ) Some drugs can damage the immune system.','install a system (= put it into a building ) Our security system is simple to install.','a system works The air-conditioning system isn’t working.','a system fails/breaks down If your immune system breaks down, you will be vulnerable to infections.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"an alarm system","translation":"یک سیستم هشدار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000608250.mp3"},{"sentence":"a well-designed heating system","translation":"سیستم گرمایشی با طراحی خوب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622087.mp3"},{"sentence":"the digestive system","translation":"دستگاه گوارش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622088.mp3"},{"sentence":"the railway system","translation":"سیستم راه آهن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000608253.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
