('c20824a1-90b6-5872-a058-16b899916883','31ad917c-486f-5260-a79d-23b7d0167733',4,null,null,'spoken & written','an idea or opinion that someone thinks is true but for which they have no proof','[ countable ]',null,'ایده یا نظری که کسی فکر می‌کند درست است اما هیچ مدرکی برای آن ندارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['come up with/develop a theory These birds helped Darwin develop his theory of natural selection.','test a theory Researchers gave workers a questionnaire to test that theory.','prove a theory No evidence emerged to prove either theory.','support a theory Modern research strongly supports this theory.','disprove a theory ( also refute a theory formal ) (= show that it is wrong ) Later experiments seemed to disprove the theory.','discredit a theory (= make people stop believing in it ) These latest findings discredit his entire theory.','a scientific theory Scientific theories can be tested experimentally.','an economic theory His economic theory assumes that both labour and capital are perfectly mobile.','a conspiracy theory (= a theory that an event was the result of secret plan made by two or more people ) A variety of conspiracy theories question the official account of President Kennedy’s assassination.','a pet theory (= a personal theory that you strongly believe ) Each of them had his pet theory on what had caused the uprising.','the theory of evolution/relativity etc According to the theory of relativity, nothing can travel faster than light.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Detectives are working on a theory that he knew his murderer.","translation":"کارآگاهان بر روی نظریه ای کار می کنند که او قاتل خود را می شناسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000594678.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('f6d819a3-3526-57eb-8568-cf2fe1fb9ed4','ef9b1232-0187-5ae4-a8c4-df7443a62b6b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to introduce a statement that makes the main statement coming after it seem surprising , unlikely , or unexpected',null,null,'اگرچه، هرچند؛ با وجود اینکه',array['although']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Though she’s almost 40, she still plans to compete.","translation":"اگرچه او تقریباً 40 سال دارد، اما همچنان قصد دارد در مسابقات شرکت کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644937.mp3"},{"sentence":"Pascal went ahead with the experiment even though he knew it was dangerous.","translation":"پاسکال با وجود اینکه می دانست خطرناک است، آزمایش را ادامه داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841712.mp3"},{"sentence":"The rooms, though small, were pleasant and airy.","translation":"اتاق ها هر چند کوچک اما دلنشین و دلنشین بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000566443.mp3"},{"sentence":"Strange though it may seem, I like housework.","translation":"هر چند عجیب به نظر می رسد، من کارهای خانه را دوست دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000566446.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('bc3bc123-29d5-5b39-a9c4-03f3f6f08d93','ef9b1232-0187-5ae4-a8c4-df7443a62b6b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used like ‘but’ to add a fact or opinion that makes what you have just said seem less definite , less important etc',null,null,'مانند "اما" برای اضافه کردن یک واقعیت یا نظر استفاده می شود که باعث می شود آنچه شما گفته اید کمتر قطعی، کمتر مهم و غیره به نظر برسد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I thought he’d been drinking, though I wasn’t completely sure.","translation":"من فکر می کردم که او مشروب می خورد، اگرچه کاملاً مطمئن نبودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000566450.mp3"},{"sentence":"The offenders were dealt with firmly though fairly.","translation":"با متخلفان با قاطعیت هر چند منصفانه برخورد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000566451.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('a38c6d3b-08fe-503e-a92d-c0660c41e6c5','ef9b1232-0187-5ae4-a8c4-df7443a62b6b',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'as though','اگرچه، هرچند؛ با وجود اینکه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('98f65804-2354-5fec-b011-76cb7b0599cd','fdca7285-9d4e-551f-9d5c-21137a4533cf',1,null,null,'spoken','used after adding a fact, opinion, or question which seems surprising after what you have just said, or which makes what you have just said seem less true',null,null,'با این حال، ولی؛ البته (تأکید)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Two heart attacks in a year. It hasn’t stopped him smoking, though.","translation":"دو حمله قلبی در یک سال با این حال، سیگار کشیدن او را متوقف نکرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000566484.mp3"},{"sentence":"It sounds like a lot of fun. Isn’t it rather risky though?","translation":"به نظر می رسد بسیار سرگرم کننده است. آیا این نسبتاً خطرناک نیست؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841722.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ac009239-1b3b-5ad2-b48b-331399638025','6eb7f856-130f-5f84-9120-4e6067a48f1b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a statement in which you tell someone that you will cause them harm or trouble if they do not do what you want','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'تهدید، تهدید (آسیب)؛ تهدید (حالت)؛ ترس (حس)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make/issue a threat Neighbours say that they heard Gardiner make threats against his wife.','carry out a threat (= do what you threatened to do ) She ought to have carried out her threat to go to the police.','give in to a threat (= do what something wants you to do after they threaten you ) The government is not going to give in to terrorist threats.','a death threat (= a threat to kill someone ) Scientists involved in the research have received death threats.','a bomb threat The station was closed because of a bomb threat.','an empty/idle threat (= one that is not sincere ) She was not a woman to make idle threats.','a veiled threat (= one that is not made directly ) The emails contained thinly veiled threats of harm.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Your threats don’t scare me.","translation":"تهدیدهای شما مرا نمی ترساند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000566965.mp3"},{"sentence":"the threat of military invasion","translation":"تهدید تهاجم نظامی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000566968.mp3"},{"sentence":"He says his family received phone threats from the group.","translation":"او می گوید که خانواده اش از سوی این گروه تهدیدهای تلفنی دریافت کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645034.mp3"},{"sentence":"threats made against his wife and children","translation":"تهدید علیه همسر و فرزندانش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001846002.mp3"},{"sentence":"Nichols never carried out his threat to resign.","translation":"نیکولز هرگز تهدید خود مبنی بر استعفا را عملی نکرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645045.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government will not give in to terrorist threats .","translation":"دولت تسلیم تهدیدات تروریستی نخواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645038.mp3"},{"sentence":"She dismissed the statement as an empty threat .","translation":"او این بیانیه را به عنوان یک تهدید توخالی رد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645051.mp3"},{"sentence":"They warned him with veiled threats not to mention anything he had witnessed.","translation":"آنها با تهدیدهای پنهان به او هشدار دادند که چیزی را که دیده است ذکر نکند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001846006.mp3"},{"sentence":"The police are investigating death threats made against the two men.","translation":"پلیس در حال بررسی تهدیدهای مرگ علیه این دو مرد است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645056.mp3"},{"sentence":"Officials at the school say they received a bomb threat at approximately 11:30 a.m. today.","translation":"مقامات این مکتب می گویند حدود ساعت 11:30 صبح امروز تهدید بمب گذاری دریافت کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645060.mp3"}]'::jsonb,10),
('35feee12-0162-58e6-97b1-149e46bf579e','6eb7f856-130f-5f84-9120-4e6067a48f1b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the possibility that something very bad will happen','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'احتمال اینکه اتفاق بسیار بدی بیفتد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the threat of famine","translation":"تهدید قحطی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000566995.mp3"},{"sentence":"According to the Secretary of State, the Russians face no threat from an expanded NATO.","translation":"به گفته وزیر امور خارجه، روس ها با هیچ تهدیدی از سوی ناتوی توسعه یافته مواجه نیستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001645066.mp3"},{"sentence":"The area remains under threat from commercial developers.","translation":"این منطقه همچنان در معرض تهدید توسعه دهندگان تجاری قرار دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001827478.mp3"},{"sentence":"The program is under threat of closure due to lack of funding.","translation":"این برنامه به دلیل کمبود بودجه در خطر بسته شدن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000566999.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('fbbdced2-54fc-5381-9245-fde81ed63e4d','6eb7f856-130f-5f84-9120-4e6067a48f1b',3,null,null,'spoken & written','someone or something that is regarded as a possible danger','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'کسی یا چیزی که به عنوان یک خطر احتمالی در نظر گرفته می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The fighting is a major threat to stability in the region.","translation":"جنگ تهدیدی بزرگ برای ثبات در منطقه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000567006.mp3"},{"sentence":"Pollution poses a threat to fish.","translation":"آلودگی ماهی ها را تهدید می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000567009.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
