('6c2ec976-159e-50d5-b13b-265e683b208b','92c5e7ba-0655-535d-8076-fdf73677ad6e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to show on Facebook that you no longer like or agree with something, after showing that you liked it',null,null,'در فیس بوک نشان دهید که دیگر چیزی را دوست ندارید یا با آن موافق نیستید، پس از اینکه نشان دادید که آن را دوست دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e7da3a62-2ce2-53ca-ad50-92fd44d4b84b','fe2b0362-7fcc-5b7a-98e5-66f55e056548',1,null,null,'spoken & written','very important and needing to be dealt with immediately',null,null,'فوری، مضطر؛ فوری (کار)؛ عاجل (نیاز)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an urgent need There is an urgent need for stricter regulation.','urgent action Urgent action is needed to boost employment.','urgent attention She believes the nation’s drug problem requires urgent attention.','an urgent message I have an urgent message for Sam – where is he?','an urgent meeting Health chiefs have called an urgent meeting to discuss the problem.','urgent talks The union is seeking urgent talks with management on this matter.','urgent business Nenna told them that she had urgent business on the other side of London.','an urgent task/job I’ve got some urgent tasks to finish before I leave tonight.','an urgent problem It’s an urgent problem, and needs tackling straight away.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He was in urgent need of medical attention.","translation":"او نیاز فوری به مراقبت های پزشکی داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620146.mp3"},{"sentence":"The report called for urgent action to reduce lead in petrol.","translation":"این گزارش خواستار اقدام فوری برای کاهش سرب در بنزین شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001620150.mp3"},{"sentence":"an urgent message","translation":"یک پیام فوری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000527044.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('a76d4340-a449-5c3b-a2fb-69110d6c5fbe','fe2b0362-7fcc-5b7a-98e5-66f55e056548',2,null,null,'formal','done or said in a way that shows that you want something to be dealt with immediately',null,null,'به گونه ای انجام شده یا گفته می شود که نشان می دهد می خواهید فوراً به چیزی رسیدگی شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an urgent need There is an urgent need for stricter regulation.','urgent action Urgent action is needed to boost employment.','urgent attention She believes the nation’s drug problem requires urgent attention.','an urgent message I have an urgent message for Sam – where is he?','an urgent meeting Health chiefs have called an urgent meeting to discuss the problem.','urgent talks The union is seeking urgent talks with management on this matter.','urgent business Nenna told them that she had urgent business on the other side of London.','an urgent task/job I’ve got some urgent tasks to finish before I leave tonight.','an urgent problem It’s an urgent problem, and needs tackling straight away.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"an urgent whisper","translation":"یک زمزمه فوری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000527052.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ce989dbc-127c-5bb9-85dc-56ec972fb481','7f727b82-c4ec-5ed1-b379-652b26acf956',1,null,null,'spoken & written','helping you to do or get what you want',null,null,'مفید، کارساز؛ سودمند (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['useful information/advice She gave me some useful advice.','a useful tip Their website has some useful tips on selling your home.','a useful way of doing something Keeping lists of the words you learn is a useful way of remembering vocabulary.','a useful tool The Internet is a useful tool for investors.','a useful contribution He played well and made a useful contribution to the team’s performance.','find something useful Did you find the book useful?','prove useful formal (= be useful ) This equipment could prove useful in testing babies’ hearing.','it is useful to do something It is useful to practise in front of an audience.','come in useful (= be useful ) The extra income would come in useful.','make yourself useful (= be helpful ) Don’t just stand there – make yourself useful!','serve a useful purpose/function (= be useful ) Sending her to prison would serve no useful purpose.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"useful information","translation":"اطلاعات مفید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001682.mp3"},{"sentence":"A little Japanese can be really useful.","translation":"کمی ژاپنی می تواند واقعا مفید باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001683.mp3"},{"sentence":"The space under the desk is useful for storing CDs.","translation":"فضای زیر میز برای نگهداری سی دی ها مفید است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001684.mp3"},{"sentence":"techniques that could be useful to teachers","translation":"تکنیک هایی که می تواند برای معلمان مفید باشد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001685.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can you come and make yourself useful (= help people to do something ) ?","translation":"آیا می توانید بیایید و خود را مفید کنید (= به مردم کمک کنید کاری انجام دهند)؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001686.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('d9bfad82-fe51-5a84-bf4c-ba5a7c4909b7','b48bbaf6-33e2-5bce-886b-2fde3a7aa041',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an area of lower land between two lines of hills or mountains , usually with a river flowing through it',null,null,'دره، دشت‌دره؛ دره (رود)؛ دره (درخت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['narrow The valley becomes narrower at this point.','wide/broad We looked down on the wide valley below.','deep/steep a bridge across a deep valley','a river valley The route passes through beautiful wooded river valleys.','a green/wooded/lush valley (= one with a lot of plants or trees growing in it ) We were on a ridge above a green valley, with the mountains beyond it.','the Thames/San Fernando etc Valley There are extensive views across the Forth Valley.','the valley floor Most of the town is built on the valley floor.','the side of a valley He looked across to the far side of the valley.','the slopes of a valley They live in houses of stone on the slopes of a wooded valley.','the head of a valley (= the higher end of a valley ) There is a great waterfall at the head of a valley.','the bottom of a valley The stream in the bottom of the valley was spanned by a narrow bridge.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the San Fernando Valley","translation":"دره سن فرناندو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001541741.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('09943c45-464c-5943-8dc6-8ae6263fd747','f2e54f50-eab1-5be0-9bb8-1974710c43b6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who has been attacked , robbed , or murdered',null,null,'قربانی، گرفتار؛ قربانی (سرطان)؛ قربانی (سرقت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The victim received head injuries from which she died a week later.","translation":"مقتول از ناحیه سر دچار جراحات شد که یک هفته بعد جان باخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001549545.mp3"},{"sentence":"Most homicide victims are under 30.","translation":"اکثر قربانیان قتل زیر 30 سال هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001549548.mp3"},{"sentence":"victims of crime","translation":"قربانیان جنایت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943482.mp3"},{"sentence":"a credit card fraud ring that stole millions of dollars from unsuspecting victims","translation":"یک حلقه کلاهبرداری از کارت اعتباری که میلیون ها دلار از قربانیان ناآگاه به سرقت برد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943483.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('86409fac-fabe-5968-9b7d-1232f1e369fc','f2e54f50-eab1-5be0-9bb8-1974710c43b6',2,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who suffers because of something bad that happens or because of an illness',null,null,'کسی که به دلیل اتفاق بدی که اتفاق می افتد یا به دلیل یک بیماری رنج می برد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a flood/earthquake/cyclone etc victim Earthquake victims were living in tents in the city''s parks.','a famine victim (= someone who has had no food to eat for a long time ) Aid is being shipped to famine victims.','a cancer/AIDS etc victim He helped raise £2,000 for a dying cancer victim.','an accident/crash victim The crash victims were rushed to hospital.','an innocent victim Children are the innocent victims of war.','an unfortunate victim If you are the unfortunate victim of a tragic accident, this card will tell doctors that you are willing to donate your organs.','a victim mentality (= when someone always thinks of themselves as a victim ) Many of us fall into a victim mentality, and blame all our troubles on other people.','a victim of circumstance (= someone who suffers because of something they cannot control ) She was a victim of circumstance, as she was born at a time when women had no power.','blame the victim (= to say that someone is responsible for their own bad situation ) It is blaming the victim to ask the woman what she does that makes her husband lose his temper and hit her.','portray somebody as a victim (= to write or talk about someone as though they are not responsible for their bad situation ) She was portrayed as the victim of a loveless marriage.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"victims of age discrimination","translation":"قربانیان تبعیض سنی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943507.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was the victim of an administrative error.","translation":"او قربانی یک اشتباه اداری شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943508.mp3"},{"sentence":"a massive aid programme for the famine victims","translation":"یک برنامه کمک بزرگ برای قربانیان قحطی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943512.mp3"},{"sentence":"AIDS victims and other patients who are terminally ill","translation":"قربانیان ایدز و سایر بیمارانی که بیماری لاعلاج دارند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943515.mp3"},{"sentence":"All these people are innocent victims .","translation":"همه این افراد قربانیان بی گناه هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943518.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was used to being in charge, not being the victim of circumstance .","translation":"او عادت داشت که مسئول باشد نه قربانی شرایط.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943522.mp3"},{"sentence":"Saying that the unemployed ‘don’t want to work’ is a classic case of blaming the victim .","translation":"گفتن اینکه بیکارها «نمی خواهند کار کنند» یک مورد کلاسیک برای سرزنش قربانی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001943526.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
