('a7f1ab5c-188f-5d98-8ba7-4cb898146cc5','5a4705f1-eb05-56db-bf58-e8b1ff7642bd',7,null,null,'old use','the state of not having with someone, or not having sex with anyone except your husband','[ uncountable ]',null,'حالتی که با کسی رابطه نداشته باشید یا با کسی به جز شوهرتان رابطه جنسی نداشته باشید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('34a0d033-77a1-52d3-bce0-8b037dae279f','77a0b744-a6e7-57e6-84ad-ea545a4ecefb',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the ability to see','[ uncountable ]',null,'بینایی، دید؛ چشم‌انداز (آینده)؛ دید (خیر)',array['sight']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['good I have good vision in my right eye.','normal Short-sighted children may be unaware of what people with normal vision can see.','perfect Babies aren’t born with perfect vision.','20–20 vision (= perfect vision ) The soldier had 20-20 vision.','poor/defective Her vision was quite poor and she always wore glasses.','blurred (= not clear ) He complained of headaches and blurred vision.','night vision (= the ability to see when it is dark ) Cats have good night vision but can’t see colour very well.','peripheral vision (= your ability to see things to the side of you when you are looking ahead ) She could read easily, but her peripheral vision was poor.','double vision (= when you see two of everything around you ) One of the symptoms of the illness is double vision.','tunnel vision (= when you can only see what you are directly looking at ) A pupil with tunnel vision may have difficulty finding the words written on the blackboard.','blur somebody’s vision (= make someone not see clearly ) Tears of fury blurred her vision, and she blinked them away.','clear your vision She blinked to clear her vision.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She suffered temporary loss of vision after being struck on the head.","translation":"وی پس از اصابت ضربه به سر دچار از دست دادن موقت بینایی شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001639849.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tears blurred her vision (= made it difficult for her to see ) .","translation":"اشک دید او را تار کرد ( = دید را برایش مشکل کرد ) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001550420.mp3"},{"sentence":"children who are born with poor vision","translation":"کودکانی که با دید ضعیف به دنیا می آیند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001639856.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('edd303e2-767b-56c2-b28a-e54ceda47b27','77a0b744-a6e7-57e6-84ad-ea545a4ecefb',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the area that you can see','[ uncountable ]',null,'منطقه ای که می توانید ببینید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['good I have good vision in my right eye.','normal Short-sighted children may be unaware of what people with normal vision can see.','perfect Babies aren’t born with perfect vision.','20–20 vision (= perfect vision ) The soldier had 20-20 vision.','poor/defective Her vision was quite poor and she always wore glasses.','blurred (= not clear ) He complained of headaches and blurred vision.','night vision (= the ability to see when it is dark ) Cats have good night vision but can’t see colour very well.','peripheral vision (= your ability to see things to the side of you when you are looking ahead ) She could read easily, but her peripheral vision was poor.','double vision (= when you see two of everything around you ) One of the symptoms of the illness is double vision.','tunnel vision (= when you can only see what you are directly looking at ) A pupil with tunnel vision may have difficulty finding the words written on the blackboard.','blur somebody’s vision (= make someone not see clearly ) Tears of fury blurred her vision, and she blinked them away.','clear your vision She blinked to clear her vision.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a figure at the edge of her vision","translation":"شکلی در لبه دید او","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001639864.mp3"},{"sentence":"As the cars overtake you, they are temporarily outside your field of vision.","translation":"همانطور که اتومبیل ها از شما سبقت می گیرند، به طور موقت خارج از میدان دید شما هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001550424.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('3df7a1f4-e11f-58dd-b0a7-b8adbe3e8087','77a0b744-a6e7-57e6-84ad-ea545a4ecefb',3,null,null,'spoken & written','an idea of what you think something should be like','[ countable ]',null,'ایده ای از اینکه فکر می کنید چیزی باید چگونه باشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['good I have good vision in my right eye.','normal Short-sighted children may be unaware of what people with normal vision can see.','perfect Babies aren’t born with perfect vision.','20–20 vision (= perfect vision ) The soldier had 20-20 vision.','poor/defective Her vision was quite poor and she always wore glasses.','blurred (= not clear ) He complained of headaches and blurred vision.','night vision (= the ability to see when it is dark ) Cats have good night vision but can’t see colour very well.','peripheral vision (= your ability to see things to the side of you when you are looking ahead ) She could read easily, but her peripheral vision was poor.','double vision (= when you see two of everything around you ) One of the symptoms of the illness is double vision.','tunnel vision (= when you can only see what you are directly looking at ) A pupil with tunnel vision may have difficulty finding the words written on the blackboard.','blur somebody’s vision (= make someone not see clearly ) Tears of fury blurred her vision, and she blinked them away.','clear your vision She blinked to clear her vision.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He had a clear vision of how he hoped the company would develop.","translation":"او چشم انداز روشنی از نحوه توسعه شرکت داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001639870.mp3"},{"sentence":"The president outlined his vision for the future.","translation":"رئیس جمهور چشم انداز خود را برای آینده تشریح کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001550436.mp3"},{"sentence":"a grand vision for the country","translation":"یک چشم انداز بزرگ برای کشور","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001968340.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
