('3dd4b047-6ee2-5339-b368-75aa95de95a7','77a0b744-a6e7-57e6-84ad-ea545a4ecefb',6,null,null,'spoken & written','the knowledge and imagination that are needed in planning for the future with a clear purpose','[ uncountable ]',null,'دانش و تخیلی که در برنامه ریزی برای آینده با هدف روشن مورد نیاز است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['good I have good vision in my right eye.','normal Short-sighted children may be unaware of what people with normal vision can see.','perfect Babies aren’t born with perfect vision.','20–20 vision (= perfect vision ) The soldier had 20-20 vision.','poor/defective Her vision was quite poor and she always wore glasses.','blurred (= not clear ) He complained of headaches and blurred vision.','night vision (= the ability to see when it is dark ) Cats have good night vision but can’t see colour very well.','peripheral vision (= your ability to see things to the side of you when you are looking ahead ) She could read easily, but her peripheral vision was poor.','double vision (= when you see two of everything around you ) One of the symptoms of the illness is double vision.','tunnel vision (= when you can only see what you are directly looking at ) A pupil with tunnel vision may have difficulty finding the words written on the blackboard.','blur somebody’s vision (= make someone not see clearly ) Tears of fury blurred her vision, and she blinked them away.','clear your vision She blinked to clear her vision.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We need a leader with vision and strong principles.","translation":"ما به رهبری با بینش و اصول قوی نیاز داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001550454.mp3"},{"sentence":"his enthusiasm and breadth of vision","translation":"اشتیاق و وسعت دید او","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001639890.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
